604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3179718862">February 7, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Title: Dragon Passions<br />A Sampler Box Set<br />Release Date: #AlreadyReleased<br />Author: Anna Lowe <br />Reviewer: Ingrid Stephanie Jordan <br />Genre:#PRN #DragonShifters<br />••••••••••••••<br />⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />Title: Lure of the Dragon #1 <br />Aloha Shifters:Jewels of the Heart <br />🔹Tessa Byrne is a human Private Chef and she’s doing well for her self under her business “Thérèse Brûler.” Than going to her new client Damien Morgan who lives at a cliffside estate in the Camelback Mountains in Phoenix. Needless to say it was an eye opener, the scariest thing she has ever seen in her life. Damien came in and smelt her and started morphing into a dragon. A DRAGON Shifter who knew they existed? If that wasn’t bad enough, he said some awful things. Now thanks to her neighbor Ella she’s in Maui, Hawaii at the Koa Point Estate. The huge gate itself is scary, should she go in? Can she ask shifters for help? Tessa has never been around shifter, Ella said that Koa means an elite class of warrior. OMG!! what is she going to do?🔹Kai Llewellyn is a Dragon Shifter and part of a secret, elite corps. There were five shifters each with a monster inside. Kai’s dragon was driving him crazy. He wouldn’t be quite, he kept talking and talking, saying that she was this mate, he needs to claim her, every five seconds. At that point Kai started to believe she was possibly his mate. The biggest question of all was WHY is Damien Morgan after Tessa? She’s nothing but a human!<br />••••••••••••<br />⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />Title: Rebel Dragon <br />Aloha Shifters: Pearls of Desire #1<br />🔹️Jenna Monroe is a human water baby, she could never get enough water. Her father owned a surf shop and she surfed every chance she got. But now she's on the run from a text stalker. The things he says give Her nightmares. So she took off to Maui to be with her older sister, Jody who lives at Koa Point with her mate Cruz. Now she realizes the supernatural do exist. 🔹️Connor Hoving is a Dragon Shifter who just left the Special Forces. Heading to be with his half brothers in Maui. This is his chance to make something of himself in the supernatural world. While flying to Maui he sits next to a beautiful women who is scared out of he mind, though she tries to hide it he can tell. Connor must protect her no matter what she's his mate! <br />••••••••••••<br />⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br />Title: Fire Madams: Paris<br />Billionaires &amp;Bodyguards #1<br />Natalie Brewer as a volunteer for the soup kitchen at least she was until she became famous with Vampires. She can’t believe there’s Vampires, Shifters, Gargoyles and Dragons.,the supernatural are alive. Better yet she can’t believe what she’s being told, there’s just no way.!🔹️Tristan Chevalier is a Dragon Shifter he has come to Paris to work for the Guardian of Paris to protect this city. But as usually things change, he is now a Bodyguard. Protecting none other then his MATE!<br /><br />☄️ This review is my own opinion, of this box set of these three books. This author is one that I love to read her books.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 likes</span