9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3181501630">February 8, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Great group of stories that give you the first books of three ofAnna Lowe's great shifter series. While dragons are the stars of these particular books other books in each series have everything from wolves to bears to lions. Each book contains a great love story with some strife and bad guys thrown in. Be sure to continue each series and then branch out and take a trip to Arizona in her Blue Moon Saloon and Twin Moon Ranch series.<br /><br />Lure of the Dragon (Alpha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart # 1)<br /><br />Wow, once again Anna knocks it out of the park. First of all there are dragons, two yummy ones and some scummy ones. There is also a wolf, a bear, a tiger, and a fox. Shifters, of course. Then there is the beautiful setting, Hawaii. There is even an Arizona connection and a hook up with our beloved wolf pack.<br /><br />Tessa is in trouble. She is a personal chef who was cooking for the wrong person..I mean dragon. Of course she didn't know he was a dragon, or even that there were dragons. Her neighbor, Ella, shows up in the nick of time to save her butt. Ella, a fox shifter, sends her to Maui to a group of shifters who can help her, cos apparently when a dragon picks you he doesn't just give up. A fact Teresa will come to appreciate, eventually.<br /><br />Kai is a dragon shifter of an entirely different kind. He sees Tessa for the first time and knows there is something about her that calls to him. Unfortunately another dragon has frightened her and Kai knows he must move slowly. He works with his cousin, Silas, Boone the wolf shifter, Cruz, a tiger shifter, and Hunter, bear shifter. There is not a lot detail yet about the others, but I am sure we will come to love them.<br />Settle in for a wild ride as Tessa tries to wrap her head around the whole shifter thing as well as some family history that will change everything. You will love it and be waiting with me to grab the next one.<br /><br />Rebel Dragon (Alpha Shifters: Pearls of Desire #1)<br /><br />Loved this first book in Anna's new series. It is a spinoff from her Jewels of the Heart series and is once again set in beautiful Hawaii. All of the shifters from that series are still around, but in secondary roles now. You don't have to read that series first to follow this one, but you should find some time to read it because it is great.<br /><br />Jenna is Jody's sister (Jody is mated with Cruz, a tiger shifter from the previous series.) She has been receiving texts from an apparent stalker and has come to Maui to work with her sister and hide out for a month. On the flight over she is seated next to a really hot guy who for some reason makes her feel safe. She wants to exchange information with him, but hey, stalker. What if he isn't what he seems?<br /><br />Connor is headed to Maui to join up with his brothers and work security for an estate where some fellow shifters are living. These guys have all found their mates and are a little too preoccupied to patrol 24/7. Connor and his team will supplement and assist. He needs to have everything go right so he and his brothers will have steady jobs and a home. His dragon bloodline is not old or royal, so he feels the need to prove himself. He can tell the woman sitting next to him on the plane is running from something, but his dragon's insistence that she is his mate can not deter him from his mission... much.<br /><br />I won't spoil the story for you, but you will like all the new shifters and admire Jenna's tenacity and bravery. I can't wait for Timber's story.<br /><br />Fire Maidens: Paris (Billionaires and Bodyguards #1)<br /><br />This is going to be a great series. We move from Hawaii to Europe for this one, which is sort of an offshoot from Jewels of the Heart and Pearls of Desire. While you don't have to read either of these two series to understand this one, you should just because they are fantastic!<br /><br />Natalie has followed her dream and come to Paris. She is all alone in the city of love but she isn't really here to find love, she is here to explore Paris and help out the less fortunate. She works to support herself, but she volunteers at a soup kitchen to give back. Her French is not the best and she uses the opportunity to improve it and to learn about the lives of those she meets there. She had never been one to believe in the supernatural, but lately she has been having strange dreams about, of all things, vampires. When a strange man comes into the soup kitchen she is not sure why she feels he is there to watch her, but for some reason he seems to be connected to the strange dreams. Vampire. Really? No, is must be her imagination.<br /><br />Tristan has been hired by the guardians of Paris to patrol and report on vampire activity. He is drawn to one of the city's soup kitchens because of one of the volunteers. When he drops in hoping to catch a glimpse of her he is immediately on alert when he senses a vampire presence. It doesn't take him long to determine that the vampire is there for the same reason he is, Natalie.<br /><br />So starts a life changing night for both Natalie and Tristan. It seems she is one of the sought after Fire Maidens whose presence in their specified city brings power and stability to the shifters who reside there and also, by association, the human population. Tristan's dragon has declared Natalie is his mate, but how can someone like him possibly be mates with someone as special as a Fire Maiden? There is no way the Guardians are going to allow that to happen.<br /><br />We also get to meet Liam, who will get his story in book 2. Love me a lion shifter.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/11652266?shelf=paranormal" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">paranormal</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/11652266?shelf=romances" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">romances</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.27226