23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3179026953">February 6, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Lure of the Dragon<br />Wow! Just when you thought you’ve read the best of Anna Lowe, she comes out with yet another winner, that just might trump anything else out there! Tessa is on the run. She is running for her life, literally, from a beast she had no idea up until yesterday, even existed. And the things he said to her…make her shudder and want to be as far away from him as possible. What she thought would be a job as a personal chef to Morgan, a top notch real estate mongul, turned out to be her worst nightmare. With the help of her neighbor, Ella, a bit of insight about shifters in general, directions of where to go, along with descriptions of those who can help protect her, she’s made a beeline for Hawaii, and what she hopes, safety. The moment Kai scents a female at the gate, he knows she’s his mate, or at least his dragon knows. If only his human side would realize that. And when the rest of the band of “merry men” give him a hard time for having brought a “human” into their ranks, and his animal side takes offence, his human side starts to believe. Now all he has to do is make them understand….and convince his mate that she’s made for him.<br />With unknown enemies, and some known but unwanted ones, this book is packed full of intrigue, action, hot and steamy dragon sex, and a whole lot of questions, some of which are answered and others that I’m sure we will soon discover the answers to. Ms. Lowe has once again delivered beyond any expectations, a wonderful beginning to what I can only hope will be another awesome series. I also love the fact that there are ties to the Twin Moon Pack, because honestly, I don’t think I could ever get enough of them or those who surround them. Definitely looking forward to the next episode<br />Rebel Dragon<br />Oh my! I'm so in love with this spin-off from the Aloha Shifters-Jewels of the Heart, series. Once again, Anna Lowe has captured our hearts with her witty and complex characters, and their constant battle, seeking a life full of love and devoid of evil. In this, the first of the new series, we are introduced to a new "gang", a mixed breed family thanks to some awesome family genes, who need new starts in life, and a greater need to prove themselves worthy of the status of "shifter".<br />When Connor and his myriad of brothers gather together for a new lease on life outside of the special ops structure, they know they have lots to prove, but will they be able to settle down enough to stay out of trouble, or will trouble come find them as usual? Jenna is running for her life! After a freak photo caption of her in a local newspaper, she's captured the unwanted attention of a stalker. The only question is whether or not he is human or of the paranormal type. Having recently discovered the origins of a second nature, she's paranoid to go anywhere. It seems that he's tracking her closely, leaving her petrified and unable to function. When a perfect opportunity comes up for her to join her sister Jody in Koa Point, Maui, she jumps at it, hoping that somehow, she will be able to loose her stalker. When Connor sits in the seat next to her on the plane, it would appear that destiny was once again showing her strength, because never has Jenna felt as safe as she did with Connor sitting there beside her, and Connor's inner dragon is certain that Jenna's their mate. Will they follow the route Destiny has set out for them, or will the odd twist and turn take them on a journey neither will ever forget?<br />An absolute wonder to read, this story will have you falling in love all over again.<br />Fire Maidens – Paris<br />It feels like forever since I’ve been able to read a new book from this unbelievably talented author, but the long, anticipated wait was definitely worth it! Wow! A new series, and what a way to start it off! You will absolutely fall in love with these characters, and the settings. Tristan and Natalie are made for each other, and the trouble that finds them as they find their way to each other only adds to the mystery. Never a dull moment, this tale will have your heart beating a bit faster, and swelling with the love. An absolute gem! So many new characters to meet and follow, I predict a new series that you definitely won’t want to miss. I know I don’t.<br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.45