2.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3181034429">February 8, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Each story is the first of three different series. Interesting, entertaining and full of action, adventure, suspense and romance. <br />Lure of the Dragon<br />For Tessa Byrne working as a private chef had become something dangerous. Almost killed and now chased by a dragon was a nightmare. Following her friend advise, she went after the men that could help her but, was she ready for more shapeshifters, trust them and the truth? Kai Llewellyn and his friends-associates had endured rough times. When he first met Tessa his dragon recognized her but, was Kai willing to accept the truth? He had to be ready to face former enemies and protect Tessa with his life. Different shifters with different traits and personalities, together and loyal to the utmost, were there to help Tessa discover the mystery behind her hunt. This first story presents the four Aloha shifters in the setting of Hawaii with what seems to be intriguing past. Interesting, entertaining with romance, hot sex, personality clashes, strong emotions, the villains always lurking in the dark and ready to attack, violence and brotherhood. Liked the detailed description, the mystery about the stones and the intriguing characters that stimulate my imagination. <br />Rebel Dragon <br />A nobody out of place, unworthy dragon, that’s how Connor Hoving had been feeling all his life. If only he had a chance to prove himself in the shifter world and rise to a position he deserved. Could Destiny and Fate join their forces to look after Connor and bring him what he needed most? Jenna was afraid, watching around all the time, but what was the threat she was hiding from? Meeting Connor seemed to be an answer to her needs, in more than one way. Intriguing and suspenseful story with characters full of mystery. Liked the adventure, the magic, the shifters, the romance and the well-crafted plot development that kept me enjoying the characters different dramas. Good beginning to the new series with an interesting mythological character that I liked and kept my attention to the details. <br />Fire Maidens Paris<br />Natalie discovered that her dreams had some truth behind. Coveted by dragons, vampires and gargoyles, she was an important piece in a game of power. Dragon shifter Tristan had not had a fair hand in his life but when he met Natalie he was struggling with his feelings and what was his duty. Natalie wasn’t sure she had enough power to make a difference but what she really knew was that Tristan was the one for her. Liked Natalie’s strong, brave, smart and decided character. She knew how to play hard and in her own terms. As a secondary character Liam was intriguing. Suspense, action, violence, betrayal, funny pet, romance and passion. Interesting and entertaining this first book of a series that promises a lot of action and intrigue.<br /><br /><br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div>