n class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3178866720">February 6, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Great intro to three of Anna Lowe's Series. Each book in her shifter series show how the author is gifted at giving inner Shifter characters a unique and amusing voice that is distinctly separate from the personalities of their human selves, and it brings lightness and heart to the suspenseful adventures. I also love that all female leads in the series become kick-ass women as they come into their gifts, and battle along with their Fated Mates.<br /><br />The Lure of the Dragon - I have never been to Hawaii, but I loved that the author invoked the tropical beauty of the island as a backdrop to a Shifter romantic adventure series. I also enjoyed the magical element of the Jewels - Spirit Stones that carry metaphysical gifts. In this book we get a hint of their meaning and power and the gifts and strengths they bring to the women who wear them that builds through the series.<br /><br />Rebel Dragon - I enjoyed the Aloha Shifters-Jewels of the Heart series so much I was delighted that the Pearls of Desire series just moved next door and interacted with previous characters and in an environment that was known and well-loved. Very exciting series with adventure and romance and once again mystical jewels - this time Pearls of Desire, that imbue their owners with magical gifts. <br /><br />Fire Maidens: Paris - I was sad when the previous two series ended and was delighted the stories continued and in some of the most beautiful European Cities. This series focuses on the reappearance of The Fire Maidens of Myth who meet their Shifter Protector Consorts and once again battle dark forces. This book is set in Paris (sigh) so you will do some wonderful sightseeing in Paris as part of the story.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=favorites" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">favorites</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=mystical-paranormal-magical" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">mystical-paranormal-magical</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=paranormal-animal-shifter" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">paranormal-animal-shifter</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.