r />Tessa never knew the world of shifters existed until she thrown into by Damien Morgan. A real estate mongrel who not only wanted her as his personal chef but his breeding dragon baby momma...lol...his mate..see Tessa had a special sumthin sumthin a few woman had that dragons needed to keep breeding dragons. Tessa was a personal chef who one day hoped to write her own cookbooks, have a loving family and definitely not be bossed around. So when she was thrown into this new world by Damien she was scared and she didnt know who she could really trust. Her chance came when she was given the second chance by and Ella a fox shifter who helped her escaped and to her to go Koa Point Estate. "You have to trust them. No one else can protect you from that monster."<br /><br />So there she stood in Maui in front of the Estate. contemplating whether to go to a hotel or trust these other shifters with her life or go to a hotel. Then a car comes up to the gate and a man steps out of a car and hubba hubba he is gorgeous. He ask if I'm coming or going. We stare. Or maybe I'm just staring. I adk him his name then he ask me mine for some reason I just blurt it outand thrn tell him why I'm here. He rushes me in the car. <br /><br />Ella had briefed me on the five elite forces. So it was no wonder. I just had to figured out who was whom. Silas was the leader scary, dragron. But the one behind her, he would protect me. No one touches her. I felt hmmmm..what's the word I'm looking for..I get to you when I find it...any who, Boone was funny, he was definitely the wolf. Hunter, damn! he was the bear. Cruz , he was stand-offish he was the tiger. Oh snap! That means, Kai was the other DRAGRON. But it was something about him that drew me to him. I was scared but not afraid, I was warm, but still felt cold like I was missing something from him.I couldn't place what it was at that moment. Until it was gone. I was gone. <br /><br />Of course, I got stuck cooking dinner. Which I didn't mind doing. Gave me a chance to show them my culinary skills. Kai and I had some alone time at a Farmer's market. I'm gonna miss this. Tessa thought. Kai loved the way she was in her element. This is his mate. He will claim her his dagron said regardless what the part of Kai though. There's something different about her. And something about her pendant around her neck. We will talk to her after dinner. After they walked back to the guest cottage. She went to bed and he went for a fly just to encounter three scouts saying they wanted his treasure. They wanted Tessa. Kai fought them off and killed two. Kai made it back to in enough time to colapse in front of Tessa in dragron form telling her to go get Silas. Would their be HEA? DRAGON BABIES, get the book? <br />REBEL DRAGON<br />Jenna had to come into the world of shifters quickly especially when she thought she was neutralized by a vampire. She needed to get away and feel safe and what better than your very own Dragon guardian by your side. Connor knew he needed to take his new job seriously for his family's sake but it was something about the girl in the seat next to him on the plane that stirred up his beast. This was a rollercoaster of affair but you had to read it to believe it and believe me it's a heart stopper. I loved every minute of it. To be sitting on your sister's couch and she then turn into this tiger and then told everyone on this estate is a shifter and your mind wonders. I can't explain the book without telling the story I can only tell you please get this book. CANNOT wait for Tim's book. Did I mention she was time enough for a sea Dragon and she whooped that tail....<br />FIRE MAIDEN'S:PARIS<br />Modern day telling of Claudine d'Islay and Breselan.<br /><br />Natalie came to Paris not become a damsel in distress or a royal princess. She had always dreamt of being amongst the parisians and doing community service. She thrives off of helping people, volunteering in soup kitchens served that purpose and gave her a sense of belonging.<br /><br />Tristan worked for the Guardian of Paris. He was to track down rogue vampires. His latest one, Olivier, crept up at the soup kitchen he frequented because of a certain young lady.<br /><br />Natalie felt deep in her soul and always listen to her instincts, so when she seen the man whom staired at her weirdly she wanted nothing to do with him but considering it was her job to serve the people she did what was tasked. After delivering him his tea he knicked her and her and licked his finger of the droplets of blood from his finger. TASTY!!! YUM!!! Tristan told hold of Nat's hand and ran for her safety. She was safe for now or was she? It was 4 vamps against her and a stranger. A mighty fine stranger. One who saved me. I should not be lusting after. But damn, a girl can dream can't she. When he gave her the way out to save her and he held off the vamps and then suddenly poof, it was one less. She did not understand what happen.<br /><br />Nat feels guilty for leaving the brave man whom finds out his name is Tristan in alley goes back to help. She finds him on the ground but alive. He convince her to take him to his place and then the next day he takes her to the Guardians for help. She doesn't really feel safe with no one but Tristan at this point. Did I forget to mention his place is a penthouse and has this questionable cat name Bijou? You will see what I mean. I almost forgot Olivier said,"you think blood like that comes along everyday? Royal blood?" See the royal twist I threw in there?<br />Without going into the book because it's so much. But sooo good. Just know that the characters in this book are insightful, some backstabber, self-sacrificing, dedicated, funny and loyal. This is one of the best suspenseful, mysterious story I've read in a long time. Not to mention best love story and when in France, let's do what the French do, nibble on some banquette. What did you think I was gonna say something else? Get your minds out the gutter. Well, this half the story so you need to get the book.<br /><br />In the beginning I mentioned this is the modern day tale of Claudine d'Islay and Breselan. I didn't tell you the story. I need you to read and look in chapter 12. A beautiful story. I really feel like telling you the whole story but I need the author to get her credit. Anna has a way to capture you and keeps you there until the end wanting more.<br /><br />See what I mean? They are like wow! And I didn't tell you the entire the plots.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4,10.8954305 4.8954305,10 6,10 L8,10 C8.60249245,10 9.14276174,10.2664091 9.50943372,10.6878531 L9.58578644,10.6036344 L11,9.18942086 L11,6.7