 book in The Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart series and I loved it. Anna's style of writing is so good you feel every emotion the characters do and the chemistry between Kai and Tessa is hot! All of the characters in this story were well-drawn and I can't wait to read their stories too.<br /><br />Tessa is new to the whole world of shifters, she has always believed herself to be 100% human, but when an evil dragon tries to kidnap her and force a mating she has a very abrupt introduction into the world of shifters. She is aided in her escape by a desert fox shifter who sends her to Maui to a group of ex-military shifters whom she is told will help keep her safe.<br /><br />Once on Maui Tessa meets five shifters, two of which are dragons, one bear, one wolf and one tiger. She then finds out that she is not fully human and has to face her destiny. She also finds her destined mate in the form of Kai. Both Kai and Tessa are really strong characters and so well suited to each other. The book was very fast-paced and full of action, twists and turns and super hot love scenes! I can not recommend this book any higher than five stars but if there were more I would give it more, for me it was both thrilling and emotional. I loved it!<br /><br />REBEL DRAGON - This book is the first in Aloha Shifters: Pearls of Desire Series which is a spinoff from her Jewels of the Heart series and is again set in Hawaii.<br /><br />It is a fantastic start to a series, the writing is excellent as you would expect from Anna Lowe, her descriptions bring the settings to life so vividly. Her characters have such depth and the plotline is very good. The two main characters in this book are Jenna (who is the sister of Jodi whom we met in the previous series) and Connor who is a dragon shifter.<br /><br />Jenna is going to Maui to work with her sister but also to get away from a stalker. Being human she has no idea that shifters exist or that her sister is mated to one. Or that the place she is going to live contains various types, dragons, wolves, bears and tigers to name but a few. On the plane over, she meets Connon not realising that they are headed to the same place. Connor is going to work at a private estate as head of security, little realising that he won't just work, he will find his destiny if he is prepared to fight for it!<br /><br />I'd love to tell you more but I won't because it would spoil this fantastic story what I can say is that there is no escaping destiny, even if it means fighting to achieve it. Jenna is both strong and brave and Connor, well Connor is a dragon how could he not be special?<br /><br />FIRE MAIDENS PARIS - This is the first book in the Billionaires &amp; Bodyguards Series. It is a standalone series which again features some great characters.<br /><br />This book is about Natalie and her Mate Tristan. Natalie believes herself to be totally human, she has grown up knowing nothing at all about shifters or the supernatural world. She is in Paris because for years she has dreamt about the city and it has been her dream to live in it. She has found herself a tiny apartment, works in a bar and helps out at a homeless shelter.<br /><br />But one night whilst working at the shelter she encounters two very different men, two men who will change her life forever! One is a vampire and one is a dragon shifter - she is about to see a whole new side to Paris. As she leaves the shelter she is attacked by four vampires and a gargoyle but is saved by Tristan a dragon shifter. They go home to his apartment in an effort to keep her safe and the next day she is taken to meet the Guardians of Paris and is told that she is descended from a powerful legendary shifter queen, that she is, in fact, a Fire Maiden and that she is the saviour the shifters of Paris have been waiting for.<br /><br />She is assigned a bodyguard, Tristan, who has returned to Paris after a decade in the Foreign Legion. His mission now is to prove himself to the Guardians of Paris and to protect the city. Being appointed as a bodyguard for Natalie is both a blessing and a curse, it's a blessing because he gets to be close to her and a curse because Natalie is off-limits, she is his charge and he feels way out of his reach.<br /><br />But just because he's been told to guard and protect but don't touch doesn't mean that the smouldering desire they both feel will go away. When Natalie is captured by bloodthirsty vampires working in tandem with Jacquline, a power-hungry she-dragon she has to dig deep and fight for both her life and Tristan's. With so much at stake, they must win!<br /><br />There is so much more I want to tell you but then I would spoil this book for you which would be unforgivable of me. What I will say is that I loved this book and if you are a fan of this genre I am sure you will too.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472