 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3615462501">November 3, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Book one of the Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the heart by Anne Lowe. <br />Tessa is a private chef hire by Damien Morgan but while there he attack her but thankfully save by a mysterious woman that told her to go to Maui. <br />Kai is a special forces dragon shifter that with a few friends/team members made a home on Maui. <br />As soon as he meets Tessa he know something special about her but after a lifetime of mistrust between humans and shifters Kai is struggling with his heart and inner dragon wanting to mate.<br />Absolutely love this first book. It’s a nice easy read/listen and I really enjoyed that the special force team are different shifters with very individual distinctive characters also loved that it was based in Maui a bucket list place for me. <br />Looking forward to more in team finding their HEA especially there leader<br /><br />Book one of the Pearls of Desire (Rebel Dragon) by Anna Lowe. <br />So this series is a spin off to Jewels of the Heart series, the mated Shifters from previous series decide they need security and hire ex-special forces team and three of the shifters are brothers to live and look after the place. <br />Connor get of a flight to Maui to start his new life as security to his friends that live at Kao point and meets his mate Jenna but because he doesn’t realise straight away the go there separate ways at the airport. <br />Jenna has been trying to get away from her stalker and decides to go see her sister at Kao Point that where she bums into Connor again and they find out their living in same place. <br />This book is a bit different to other because three of the shifters are brothers but surprisingly they are different shifter animals because there deadbeat dad could shift into anything and they all have different mothers. <br />I absolutely loved that Jenna didn’t resist much when things heated up with her and Connor and it felt like the relationship developed really nicely and naturally. <br />Only things would say I had against this book is that Jenna never really turns into a proper mermaid but she’s really new to it and I might develop this later in series. <br />The narrator was good but at times did come across as slightly fluffy too upbeat cheerleader which I hadn’t experience with Kelsey Osborne before but I just speeded up the narration speed and which made it a lot better. <br /><br />Book 1 of the Fire maiden series by Anna Lowe<br />Natalie has always wanted to live in Paris and after years of saving she moved to Paris and started living and working there and also volunteer in a homeless centre. <br />One night Natalie was attacked by a vampire and saved by Tristan a dragon. That’s when Natalie is brought into the supernatural world and she finds out that she’s a Fire Maiden and has the power to balance the supernatural world in Paris and bring it to a new calm it only feels that way with a Fire Maiden living happily. <br />Absolutely loved this new series and I have a new love for Kelsey Osborne that not only have the talent to give each character a very individual presence but also had a great french accent as well. <br />Even though this book did have a HEA and a proper ending the bad guy and conflict was definitely left as a cliffhanger looking forward to more of this amazing series. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4,10.8954305 4.8954305,10 6,10 L8,10 C8.60249245,10 9.14276174,10.2664091 9.50943372,10.6878531 L9.58578644,10.6036344 L11,9.18942086 L11,6.75238209 C10.9999468,5.91477784 11.5910613,5.19356674 12.4123594,5.02913493 C13.3640475,4.8385978 14.290004,5.45563256 14.4813282,6.41129383 Z M8,11 L6,11 C5.44771525,11 5,11.4477153 5,12 L5,17 C5,17.5522847 5.44771525,18 6,18 L8,18 C8.55228475,18 9,17.5522847 9,17 L9,12 C9,11.4477153 8.55228475,11 8,11 Z M12.6086732,6.00967606 C12.2547259,6.08053973 11.9999771,6.39134718 12,6.7523186