fters series. We meet them all, but our main character is Kai who is a dragon shifter. Private Chef Tessa just found out there are such things as dragon shifters when one client reveals his true nature and promises to mate her. (Yikes!) Rescued by her neighbor who is also a shifter, Tessa flees to Maui asking for protection from the team at Koa Point.<br /><br />Anna Lowe evokes more “feeling” in her stories than 99% of the authors I read. We immediately relate to each member of the team, feel Tessa’s confusion, and become totally engrossed in the story. It doesn’t hurt that I lived a few years in Hawaii as a kid and as she describes the tropical setting it brings back fond memories. <br /><br />The story is full of twists, danger, attraction and quite the thrill ride!! It delights me to see there are plans for at least four more stories in this series!! I really need additional stars to award for this one.<br /><br /><br />Rebel Dragon: **********************************************************<br />Surfer Jenna has come to Maui to visit her sister and escape a stalker. At Koa Point she finds out the true nature of her sister and the guys on the security team around her. Thrown for a loop she walks along the ocean where she has always felt comfortable.<br /><br />Conner Hoving is a dragon-shifter who with his team is moving next door to Koa Point at Koakea Plantation. With a father who was a myriad shifter meaning each offspring could be any animal – he was not raised in the protocol of the dragon realm. When these two meet, Conner’s dragon gets very interested and very protective.<br /><br />Jenna is struggling with the fact her sister turns into an eight-foot tiger, the fact she has a little something extra herself and that vampires really exist.<br /><br />A brilliant island adventure with dragons, tigers and bears….not to mention a feisty kitten and scintillating romance of the fated mate variety. Block off your calendar as you will not be able to put this one down!!<br /><br /><br />Fire Maidens: Paris **********************************************************<br />No Matter the Location; These Shifter Stories are amazing – Taking Europe by Storm!!<br />Tristan is a dragon-shifter Guardian working to keep the vampires of Paris in check. When they attack a human Natalie, Tristan is there to save her. His dragon is impressed. Natalie is not unaffected:<br /><br />“It was ridiculous, reacting to a near-stranger that way. In three years of dating a guy named Dean in Philly, she’d never gotten as excited as she got around Mr. Tall, Dark, and distinctly Parisian.”<br /><br />Can she be the “mythical” Fire Maiden who can help save Paris? Imagine not only finding paranormals exist, but you may be one….<br /><br />Intricate story of honor, duty, jealousy, magic and love. A lovely cat Bijou (jewel) is an additional feature which adds to the depth and believability of this highly entertaining read.<br /><br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.17082