.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3185169521">February 10, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">This is an awesome box set! This provides the first book in 3 different amazing series! <br /><br />Lure of the Dragon is the beginning of the Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart series. In an effort to escape a really bad situation, Tessa ends up with Kai and his group of shifters. The fun thing about all the characters in this group is that they're different shifters, they're not all dragons. Kai's brother Silas (also a dragon) seems to be the leader of this group. Tessa is being chased by another dragon (the one she escaped from) and Kai's there to help her. From the moment Kai met Tessa, his dragon was saying she was their mate. Unfortunately, Kai knew that Tessa was human and a dragon's bite is too much for a human as evidenced by his mom. This is a great read to watch how Kai battles not only the dragons to save Tessa but also to watch their love unfold.<br /><br />Rebel Dragon - Aloha Shifters: Pearls of Desire is a new series and Rebel Dragon is the first book in the series.<br />This group is located in Hawaii and has joined the group of shifters that were written about in the Lure of the Dragon, Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart series. Connor and his brothers have come to Hawaii to start over. He feels like it's one of his last chances to prove himself even though he was special forces. While flying to Maui, he meets Jenna, a shy and frightened woman on his flight. Jenna is on her way to meet her sister and escape from what she things may be a crazed vampire stalker. She's hoping to get away but keeps watching over her shoulder fearing she'll never be safe. Connor promises to protect her and she falls asleep on the flight. By the time, the plane lands, they feel a strange connection but part ways with no way of contacting each other. As luck would have it Jenna is sisters with Jody who is mated to Cruz (who's part of the shifters already set up on Maui and the group that Connor is going to join).<br /><br />They meet the next day and the pull keeps getting stronger. But Jenna's not telling everyone the truth about her stalker and Connor is trying not to mess up this new job and wants to prove himself as the alpha and take over this new group of shifters. This begins the fun part of the book where you get to see Jenna and Connor and their coming together. Such a great read and an epic battle! Can't wait to read more about this new clan, especially Cynthia and Dell.<br /><br />Fire Maidens: Paris - This is book one in the Billionaires and Bodyguard Series. This is series is set throughout Europe with each country looking for a "fire Maiden" who will reside in their country and bring calm to their country. Although each time, the fire maiden doesn't even realize that she's a shifter. <br />Enter Natalie, a human who has left her country to see Paris, but she keeps having two very different dreams involving shifters (vampires and dragons). That's where dragonshifter, Tristan comes in. Natalie doesn't want to believe the tales that Tristan is telling her but she's grateful for him saving her. Can she trust him? This is a great start to another wonderful series by Anne Lowe!<br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></sp