z from the last series and they are both tiger shifters. But Jenna is a human and mermaid mix, she also has a stalker out to get her so she runs to Maui for help.<br />Connor and his team are ex special forces who want to make a new lifeature for themselves. He is also a dragon shifter who has come to work security at Koa Point the same place Jenna ran to for safety. Destiny is at work!<br />I LOVE this story! Great characters their so easy to connect to. Awesome action, drama, mystery, intrigue, suspense, twist, turns and soooooo much more. It's amazing. I couldn't put it down! The audio version is fantastic too kelsey Osborne makes the story spring to life it was so much fun to hear it.<br /><br />Book 3<br />Fire maidens : Paris <br />Natlie Brewer had dreams of going to Paris so she did. Everything changed when a vampire attacked . Who knew those things were real well she didn't. She didn't even know she had a heritage in her bloodline that was attracting them to her.<br />Gargoyles, vampires, and dragons oh my!<br />Tristan Chevalier's mission is to prove himself to the Guardians of Paris. Protect the city by watching the vampires and reporting on them but when he see natalie in trouble he can't just sit watch and report. Plus his Dragon has other plans for the little human that he is on board with.<br />Love the action, drama, mystery, betrayal, spice, and so much more this story has going on in it. The characters are fantastic! The story really pulls you in fast and keeps you interested. I really enjoyed reading this one and can't wait for the next story to come out about London and the next fire maiden.<br /><br />Great set don't miss it . I love the action and spice in all these books!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__actio