nflict, lust, emotional feelings, love, steamy scenes &amp; a happy conclusion. <br /><br />**Rebel Dragon – Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart #1**<br />There is: a young female (Jenna) who is on the run from a stalker and goes to her sister (Jodi) in Koa Point, Maui. On the plane, she meets a man (Connor, a dragon shifter) who is also on his way to the same place, to start a new job in security with his fellow brothers, various kinds of shifters, a apparently human female, a stalker, drama, intrigue, suspense, twists &amp; turns, fated mates, enemies, action, adventure, surprises, magical pearls, attractions, danger, conflict, love, passion, steamy scenes &amp; a wonderful happy conclusion.<br /><br />**Fire Maidens: Paris - Billionaires &amp; Bodyguards #1**<br />There is: a young woman (Natalie) decides to move to Paris after a bad experience &amp; discovers a unknown world, a dragon shifter (Tristan) saves her from danger &amp; is determined to protect her, various kinds of shifters, vampires, dragon shifters, twists &amp; turns, intrigue, suspense, drama, mystery, villains, fated mates, adventure, action, danger, threats, violence, attractions, deceit, betrayal, manipulations, devious plans, confrontations, love, happiness, laughter, steamy scenes &amp; a truly delightful epilogue.<br />I would recommend this box-set to people who like to read this genre, I really doubt that you would be disappointed.<br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/51861022?shelf=finished-reading" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">finished-reading</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria