27L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3180367475">February 7, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Lure of the Dragon - Tessa was attacked and is heads to Hawaii on the word of her friend/neighbor Ella. Trusting that the strangers will really help her. Kai has a feeling that draws him home in time to find Tessa trying to decide if she is ready to ask for help or wait till morning. Kai and his family don't really trust humans much, but she says Ella sent her. Kai also can't help but be drawn to Tessa and he plans on protecting her from the world.<br />I really enjoyed this new series and can't wait to find out more about Kai's family, especially Cruz and Boone! Looking forward to the next book and hoping that Ella makes an appearance so we can get to know her as well.<br /><br />Rebel Dragon - Jenna is heading to visit her sister in Hawaii, and also trying to lose her stalker. Conrad along with his brothers and teammates are getting a fresh start after leaving the Special Forces. Jenna's sister told her a few months back that vampires and other things are real and could come looking for her. It was hard to swallow, but it's also becoming the stuff of her nightmares.<br />Jenna and Conrad share a flight to the island and part ways after the flight even though they are drawn to one another. They soon run into one another, and Jenna gets and interesting surprise from her sister Jody, which leads to some other surprises. One thing leads to another and the bad guys are kind of a surprise. Jenna and Conrad are awesome and I can't wait to find out what happens with the other guys and Cynthia. The woman is hiding a lot.<br /><br />Fire Maidens: Paris - Natalie headed to Paris to live out her dreams, not planning on finding her self dealing with the stuff of nightmares. Tristan is trying to find his place in the world after leaving the Military. When he saves her and their two worlds collide, it just may be the thing they both needed most. I love Natalie and how she manages to roll with the punches that life seems to throw her way. She faces her reality and doesn't run from it. I loved Liam and can't wait to read his story also.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.