/review/show/3185268551">February 11, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Lure of the Dragon<br />More Than Meets the Eye<br /><br />Great story. Miss Lowe's new story of the Aloha Shifters I expect to be a hit with her readers. getting to know a group of shifters who were in the military together and seeing where life takes them at this point just never gets old.<br /><br />In this book you're introduced to Kai and Tessa. Kai being a dragon and a jacket of all trades. While Tessa is a personal chef who is being hunted by other dragons.<br /><br />The story reads swiftly with nary a bump in the telling the characters are well-developed I'm not for sure what more you could ask for great job.<br /><br />The Mating Bite and A Dragon's Honeymoon just add more spice to the original story. Do forget to read these bonus additions.<br /><br />Looking forward to the next book Lure of the Wolf.<br /><br />Rebel Dragon<br />Second Nature<br /><br />This book has more depth than any of the previous stories. I love it. The characters feel a little more complex with back stories I can’t wait to read about. The family dynamic is serious skewed which makes for a better story.<br /><br />There is a misconception that takes the characters on a different path with it being more dangerous than previously thought by Jenna and Connor. These characters work so well together. Each has their own strength and weaknesses that are perceived differently by others and themselves. I love the fact that they grow and evolve throughout the story.<br />Can’t wait for the next book in this series.<br /><br />Fire Maidens -Paris<br />Believe In us<br /><br />The start of another series by one of my must read authors.<br /><br />Coming to Paris has always been a dream for Natalie since she was younger but she imagine how she was going to get there.<br /><br />Tristan has lived in many places but Paris has always been his favorite so once he strikes out from his parents it's where chooses to reside.<br /><br />The story has a slower build up that some readers may not care for but my recommendation is to power through it and you will get an intriguing and we'll written affair.<br /><br />I review books so that others can see that a book may be worth reading. <br /><br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4,10.8954305 4.8954305,10 6,10 L8,10 C8.60249245,10 9.14276174,10.2664091 9.50943372,10.6878531 L9.58578644,10.6036344 L11,9.18942086 L11,6.752