ide in secret. Then your reader journey takes to the romantic city of Paris, where lovers walk hand in hand beneath the nighttime sky. Nightmarish danger lurks in the shadows searching for a Fire Maiden. Behind closed doors, Guardian shifters plot to protect the city from dangerous beings that prowl the streets. Each story features awesome character interaction, witty flirty innuendos, phenomenal vivid scene descriptions, heart-tugging moments, suspense, action, life-threatening moments, sizzling fiery romances, and happy forever endings.<br /><br />“Lure of the Dragon” features Tessa a fiery red-head and private chef who meets Kai a dragon shifter. Tessa is feisty, and a force to be reckoned with. She is not afraid to stand up to the powerful dragon Kai who over time bends to accept her independent persona.<br /><br />“Rebel Dragon” features Connor a buffed gorgeous dragon shifter who has his work cut out for him when he accepts a security job in Maui. He has always been a rule breaker. Jenna a dazzling, sassy surfer comes to Maui to see her sister. Jenna needs protection from a stalker that haunts her. Connor and Jenna's romance is off-limits, but destiny has other ideas.<br /><br />“Fire Maidens: Paris” features Natalie a caring intelligent woman finds herself in horrific danger. Tristan a hot-blooded dragon shifter, is chosen by the Guardians to be her bodyguard. Destiny has paired these two to meet, and when they do fiery desires of the heart sprout. They face quite a few scary hurdles before reaching their heavenly happy ever after.<br /><br />Spectacular, thrilling entertaining storylines with praiseworthy characters. Each romance sizzles and is more than convincing. I enjoyed reading all these stories, and I look forward to reading more by this author.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="Socia