 into 3 wonderful series with this set. Lure of the Dragon starts off the yummy Kai, a wonderful woman on his doorstep, and a legacy. I loved this series because they were hot dragons, marshmallow men for their women, and a tight knit family group. <br /><br />Rebel Dragon starts the next series off and is just as delectable. Connor is the leader of this group and it is a little more rag tagged and brotherhood. He can’t afford for any of them to screw up. And then there is fate. You can’t help but to be team Connor. <br /><br />Fire Maidens of Paris starts the jaunt around the world. Forget Hawaii in the last two series, get packing and solve the mysteries of the shifters and the Fire Maidens starting with Paris. Natalie was so gentle and good natured. Tristan was chivalrous and ever present for her. I loved them both and couldn’t wait for the next city on the tour when the story ended. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314