m/series/205049-aloha-shifters-jewels-of-the-heart"},"Series:kca://series/amzn1.gr.series.v1.i3S4XWiPvXYdw8Pys0_ygw":{"__typename":"Series","id":"kca://series/amzn1.gr.series.v1.i3S4XWiPvXYdw8Pys0_ygw","title":"Aloha Shifters: Pearls of Desire","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/series/237165-aloha-shifters-pearls-of-desire"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","legacyId":50979502,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/50979502-dragon-passions","viewerShelving":null,"title":"Dragon Passions","titleComplete":"Dragon Passions","description":"Three fiery \u0026amp; suspenseful paranormal romances\u003cbr /\u003eHot alpha heroes. Kickass heroines. Ruthless enemies. Exotic locations that ignite passionate romance!\u2028\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDiscover your next hot alpha hero in this unforgettable volume of steamy \u0026amp; suspenseful paranormal romance! Each story puts the “hero” back into “heroine” and introduces a rich story world, from the tropical Hawaii of Magnum, PI to the shady shifter side of Paris, the City of Lights. Sizzling romance and hot military heroes guaranteed!\u2028\u2028\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn Lure of the Dragon, Kai Llewellyn and his band of battle-hardened shapeshifters know the rules: Don’t trust a human, and never, ever fall in love with one. But Tessa is different. Her emerald eyes mirror the mysterious pendant she wears, and her flaming red hair makes Kai’s heart race. Is his inner dragon just greedy for a new kind of treasure, or is Tessa his destined mate?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn Rebel Dragon, Special Forces vet Connor Hoving’s whole future — and that of his brothers — depends on acing his new job as head of security at an exclusive seaside estate. But Connor can barely get his inner dragon to focus with alluring, off-limits Jenna around. Can this rebel dragon learn to play by the rules when his true love’s life is on the line?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd in Fire Maidens: Paris, dragon shifter Tristan Chevalier is appointed bodyguard to his destined mate. The problem? Natalie is absolutely, positively off-limits despite the smoldering desire they both feel. Worse, every shifter in Paris has set their sights on her, from bloodthirsty vampires to power-hungry dragons and jealous rivals. For Tristan, it’s the test of a lifetime, and the outcome will affect the fortunes of an entire city.\u2028\u2028\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEach of these stories is Book 1 in a different best-selling series. What better way to decide which great series to start your next binge read with? Get your copy of Dragon Passions today!","description({\"stripped\":true})":"Three fiery \u0026 suspenseful paranormal romances\r\nHot alpha heroes. Kickass heroines. Ruthless enemies. Exotic locations that ignite passionate romance!\u2028\r\n\r\nDiscover your next hot alpha hero in this unforgettable volume of steamy \u0026 suspenseful paranormal romance! Each story puts the “hero” back into “heroine” and introduces a rich story world, from the tropical Hawaii of Magnum, PI to the shady shifter side of Paris, the City of Lights. Sizzling romance and hot military heroes guaranteed!\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nIn Lure of the Dragon, Kai Llewellyn and his band of battle-hardened shapeshifters know the rules: Don’t trust a human, and never, ever fall in love with one. But Tessa is different. Her emerald eyes mirror the mysterious pendant she wears, and her flaming red hair makes Kai’s heart race. Is his inner dragon just greedy for a new kind of treasure, or is Tessa his destined mate?\r\n\r\nIn Rebel Dragon, Special Forces vet Connor Hoving’s whole future — and that of his brothers — depends on acing his new job as head of security at an exclusive seaside estate. But Connor can barely get his inner dragon to focus with alluring, off-limits Jenna around. Can this rebel dragon learn to play by the rules when his true love’s life is on the line?\r\n\r\nAnd in Fire Maidens: Paris, dragon shifter Tristan Chevalier is appointed bodyguard to his destined mate. The problem? Natalie is absolutely, positively off-limits despite the smoldering desire they both feel. Worse, every shifter in Paris has set their sights on her, from bloodthirsty vampires to power-hungry dragons and jealous rivals. For Tristan, it’s the test of a lifetime, and the outcome will affect the fortunes of an entire city.\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nEach of these stories is Book 1 in a different best-selling series. What better way to decide which great series to start your next binge read with? Get your copy of Dragon Passions today!","primaryContributorEdge":{"__typename":"BookContributorEdge","node":{"__ref":"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v1.imyojG_M7U_za78tk1mLVg"},"role":"Author"},"secondaryContributorEdges":[],"imageUrl":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1580745870i/50979502.jpg","bookSeries":[{"__typename":"BookSeries","userPosition":"1","series":{"__ref":"Series:kca://series/amzn1.gr.series.v1.otFi6SBuJ3CLu9wO0kVzbQ"}},{"__typename":"BookSeries","userPosition":"1","series":{"__ref":"Series:kca://series/amzn1.gr.series.v1.i3S4XWiPvXYdw8Pys0_ygw"}}],"bookGenres":[{"__typename":"BookGenre","genre":{"__typename":"Genre","name":"Paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/genres/paranormal"}},{"__typename":"BookGenre","genre":{"__typename":"Genre","name":"Dragons","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/genres/dragons"}},{"__typename":"BookGenre","genre":{"__typename":"Genre","name":"Shapeshifters","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/genres/shapeshifters"}},{"__typename":"BookGenre","genre":{"__typename":"Genre","name":"Anthologies","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/genres/anthologies"}},{"__typename":"BookGenre","genre":{"__typename":"Genre","name":"Paranormal Romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/genres/paranormal-romance"}},{"__typename":"BookGenre","genre"