DRAGON Shifter who knew they existed? If that wasn’t bad enough, he said some awful things. Now thanks to her neighbor Ella she’s in Maui, Hawaii at the Koa Point Estate. The huge gate itself is scary, should she go in? Can she ask shifters for help? Tessa has never been around shifter, Ella said that Koa means an elite class of warrior. OMG!! what is she going to do?🔹Kai Llewellyn is a Dragon Shifter and part of a secret, elite corps. There were five shifters each with a monster inside. Kai’s dragon was driving him crazy. He wouldn’t be quite, he kept talking and talking, saying that she was this mate, he needs to claim her, every five seconds. At that point Kai started to believe she was possibly his mate. The biggest question of all was WHY is Damien Morgan after Tessa? She’s nothing but a human!\u003cbr /\u003e••••••••••••\u003cbr /\u003e⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003eTitle: Rebel Dragon \u003cbr /\u003eAloha Shifters: Pearls of Desire #1\u003cbr /\u003e🔹️Jenna Monroe is a human water baby, she could never get enough water. Her father owned a surf shop and she surfed every chance she got. But now she's on the run from a text stalker. The things he says give Her nightmares. So she took off to Maui to be with her older sister, Jody who lives at Koa Point with her mate Cruz. Now she realizes the supernatural do exist. 🔹️Connor Hoving is a Dragon Shifter who just left the Special Forces. Heading to be with his half brothers in Maui. This is his chance to make something of himself in the supernatural world. While flying to Maui he sits next to a beautiful women who is scared out of he mind, though she tries to hide it he can tell. Connor must protect her no matter what she's his mate! \u003cbr /\u003e••••••••••••\u003cbr /\u003e⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003eTitle: Fire Madams: Paris\u003cbr /\u003eBillionaires \u0026amp;Bodyguards #1\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie Brewer as a volunteer for the soup kitchen at least she was until she became famous with Vampires. She can’t believe there’s Vampires, Shifters, Gargoyles and Dragons.,the supernatural are alive. Better yet she can’t believe what she’s being told, there’s just no way.!🔹️Tristan Chevalier is a Dragon Shifter he has come to Paris to work for the Guardian of Paris to protect this city. But as usually things change, he is now a Bodyguard. Protecting none other then his MATE!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e☄️ This review is my own opinion, of this box set of these three books. This author is one that I love to read her books.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3IUMSZH2GKQ6D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:11652266":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":11652266,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1349728276i/11652266.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":3873,"name":"Denise","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/11652266-denise","contributor":null,"id":11652266},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3FLTDDOPRKHAX":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3FLTDDOPRKHAX"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3FLTDDOPRKHAX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3FLTDDOPRKHAX","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3FLTDDOPRKHAX"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/11652266?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/11652266?shelf=paranormal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romances","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/11652266?shelf=romances"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3181501630"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.EMMCCJ-5TzGK5xXDiWPF_w":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.EMMCCJ-5TzGK5xXDiWPF_w","creator":{"__ref":"User:11652266"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581272753072,"createdAt":1581175128360,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581175164750,"text":"Great group of stories that give you the first books of three ofAnna Lowe's great shifter series. While dragons are the stars of these particular books other books in each series have everything from wolves to bears to lions. Each book contains a great love story with some strife and bad guys thrown in. Be sure to continue each series and then branch out and take a trip to Arizona in her Blue Moon Saloon and Twin Moon Ranch series.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Dragon (Alpha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart # 1)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWow, once again Anna knocks it out of the park. First of all there are dragons, two yummy ones and some scummy ones. There is also a wolf, a bear, a tiger, and a fox. Shifters, of course. Then there is the beautiful setting, Hawaii. There is even an Arizona connection and a hook up with our beloved wolf pack.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTessa is in trouble. She is a personal chef who was cooking for the wrong person..I mean dragon. Of course she didn't know he was a dragon, or even that there were dragons. Her neighbor, Ella, shows up in the nick of time to save her butt. Ella, a fox shifter, sends her to Maui to a group of shifters who can help her, cos apparently when a dragon picks you he doesn't just give up. A fact Teresa will come to appreciate, eventually.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKai is a dragon shifter of an entirely different kind. He sees Tessa for the first time and knows there is something about her that calls to him. Unfortunately another dragon has frightened her and Kai knows he must move slowly. He works with his cousin, Silas, Boone the wolf shifter, Cruz, a tiger shifter, and Hunter, bear shifter. There is not a lot detail yet about the others, but I am sure we will come to love them.\u003cbr /\u003eSettle in for a wild ride as Tessa tries to wrap her head around the whole shifter thing as well as some family history that will change everything. You will love it and be waiting with me to grab the next one.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon (Alpha Shifters: Pearls of Desire #1)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLoved this first book in Anna's new series. It is a spinoff from her Jewels of the Heart series and is once again set in beautiful Hawaii. All of the shifters from that series are still around, but in secondary roles now. You don't have to read that series first to follow this one, but you should find some time to read it because it is great.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJenna is Jody's sister (Jody is mated with Cruz, a tiger shifter from the previous series.) She has been receiving texts from an apparent stalker and has come to Maui to work with her sister and hide out for a month. On the flight over she is seated next to a really hot guy who for some reason makes her feel safe. She wants to exchange information with him, but hey, stalker. What if he isn't what he seems?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eConnor is headed to Maui to join up with his brothers and work security for an estate where some fellow shifters are living. These guys have all found their mates and are a little too preoccupied to patrol 24/7. Connor and his team will supplement and assist. He needs to have everything go right so he and his brothers will have steady jobs and a home. His dragon bloodline is not old or royal, so he feels the need to prove himself. He can tell the woman sitting next to him on the plane is running from something, but his dragon's insistence that she is his mate can not deter him from his mission... much.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI won't spoil the story for you, but you will like all the new shifters and admire Jenna's tenacity and bravery. I can't wait for Timber's story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens: Paris (Billionaires and Bodyguards #1)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is going to be a great series. We move from Hawaii to Europe for this one, which is sort of an offshoot from Jewels of the Heart and Pearls of Desire. While you don't have to read either of these two series to understand this one, you should just because they are fantastic!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie has followed her dream and come to Paris. She is all alone in the city of love but she isn't really here to find love, she is here to explore Paris and help out the less fortunate. She works to support herself, but she volunteers at a soup kitchen to give back. Her French is not the best and she uses the opportunity to improve it and to learn about the lives of those she meets there. She had never been one to believe in the supernatural, but lately she has been having strange dreams about, of all things, vampires. When a strange man comes into the soup kitchen she is not sure why she feels he is there to watch her, but for some reason he seems to be connected to the strange dreams. Vampire. Really? No, is must be her imagination.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTristan has been hired by the guardians of Paris to patrol and report on vampire activity. He is drawn to one of the city's soup kitchens because of one of the volunteers. When he drops in hoping to catch a glimpse of her he is immediately on alert when he senses a vampire presence. It doesn't take him long to determine that the vampire is there for the same reason he is, Natalie.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSo starts a life changing night for both Natalie and Tristan. It seems she is one of the sought after Fire Maidens whose presence in their specified city brings power and stability to the shifters who reside there and also, by association, the human population. Tristan's dragon has declared Natalie is his mate, but how can someone like him possibly be mates with someone as special as a Fire Maiden? There is no way the Guardians are going to allow that to happen.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe also get to meet Liam, who will get his story in book 2. Love me a lion shifter.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3FLTDDOPRKHAX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:27077906":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":27077906,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1388263415i/27077906.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":5,"textReviewsCount":1409,"name":"Cindy Caron","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/27077906-cindy-caron","contributor":null,"id":27077906},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27077906?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3179026953"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.DhbkA-uZx9mA6DWnvw7Vbw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.DhbkA-uZx9mA6DWnvw7Vbw","creator":{"__ref":"User:27077906"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581098867170,"createdAt":1581018750017,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581018766795,"text":"Lure of the Dragon\u003cbr /\u003eWow! Just when you thought you’ve read the best of Anna Lowe, she comes out with yet another winner, that just might trump anything else out there! Tessa is on the run. She is running for her life, literally, from a beast she had no idea up until yesterday, even existed. And the things he said to her…make her shudder and want to be as far away from him as possible. What she thought would be a job as a personal chef to Morgan, a top notch real estate mongul, turned out to be her worst nightmare. With the help of her neighbor, Ella, a bit of insight about shifters in general, directions of where to go, along with descriptions of those who can help protect her, she’s made a beeline for Hawaii, and what she hopes, safety. The moment Kai scents a female at the gate, he knows she’s his mate, or at least his dragon knows. If only his human side would realize that. And when the rest of the band of “merry men” give him a hard time for having brought a “human” into their ranks, and his animal side takes offence, his human side starts to believe. Now all he has to do is make them understand….and convince his mate that she’s made for him.\u003cbr /\u003eWith unknown enemies, and some known but unwanted ones, this book is packed full of intrigue, action, hot and steamy dragon sex, and a whole lot of questions, some of which are answered and others that I’m sure we will soon discover the answers to. Ms. Lowe has once again delivered beyond any expectations, a wonderful beginning to what I can only hope will be another awesome series. I also love the fact that there are ties to the Twin Moon Pack, because honestly, I don’t think I could ever get enough of them or those who surround them. Definitely looking forward to the next episode\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon\u003cbr /\u003eOh my! I'm so in love with this spin-off from the Aloha Shifters-Jewels of the Heart, series. Once again, Anna Lowe has captured our hearts with her witty and complex characters, and their constant battle, seeking a life full of love and devoid of evil. In this, the first of the new series, we are introduced to a new \"gang\", a mixed breed family thanks to some awesome family genes, who need new starts in life, and a greater need to prove themselves worthy of the status of \"shifter\".\u003cbr /\u003eWhen Connor and his myriad of brothers gather together for a new lease on life outside of the special ops structure, they know they have lots to prove, but will they be able to settle down enough to stay out of trouble, or will trouble come find them as usual? Jenna is running for her life! After a freak photo caption of her in a local newspaper, she's captured the unwanted attention of a stalker. The only question is whether or not he is human or of the paranormal type. Having recently discovered the origins of a second nature, she's paranoid to go anywhere. It seems that he's tracking her closely, leaving her petrified and unable to function. When a perfect opportunity comes up for her to join her sister Jody in Koa Point, Maui, she jumps at it, hoping that somehow, she will be able to loose her stalker. When Connor sits in the seat next to her on the plane, it would appear that destiny was once again showing her strength, because never has Jenna felt as safe as she did with Connor sitting there beside her, and Connor's inner dragon is certain that Jenna's their mate. Will they follow the route Destiny has set out for them, or will the odd twist and turn take them on a journey neither will ever forget?\u003cbr /\u003eAn absolute wonder to read, this story will have you falling in love all over again.\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens – Paris\u003cbr /\u003eIt feels like forever since I’ve been able to read a new book from this unbelievably talented author, but the long, anticipated wait was definitely worth it! Wow! A new series, and what a way to start it off! You will absolutely fall in love with these characters, and the settings. Tristan and Natalie are made for each other, and the trouble that finds them as they find their way to each other only adds to the mystery. Never a dull moment, this tale will have your heart beating a bit faster, and swelling with the love. An absolute gem! So many new characters to meet and follow, I predict a new series that you definitely won’t want to miss. I know I don’t.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:31085833":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":31085833,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":14,"textReviewsCount":1965,"name":"Dora","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/31085833-dora","contributor":null,"id":31085833},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A16X4UH8QT358Z":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A16X4UH8QT358Z"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A16X4UH8QT358Z\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A16X4UH8QT358Z","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A16X4UH8QT358Z"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/31085833?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3181034429"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pMtpWPiMVKevkHw_TrBWeg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pMtpWPiMVKevkHw_TrBWeg","creator":{"__ref":"User:31085833"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581272752385,"createdAt":1581137283891,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581137310025,"text":"Each story is the first of three different series. Interesting, entertaining and full of action, adventure, suspense and romance. \u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Dragon\u003cbr /\u003eFor Tessa Byrne working as a private chef had become something dangerous. Almost killed and now chased by a dragon was a nightmare. Following her friend advise, she went after the men that could help her but, was she ready for more shapeshifters, trust them and the truth? Kai Llewellyn and his friends-associates had endured rough times. When he first met Tessa his dragon recognized her but, was Kai willing to accept the truth? He had to be ready to face former enemies and protect Tessa with his life. Different shifters with different traits and personalities, together and loyal to the utmost, were there to help Tessa discover the mystery behind her hunt. This first story presents the four Aloha shifters in the setting of Hawaii with what seems to be intriguing past. Interesting, entertaining with romance, hot sex, personality clashes, strong emotions, the villains always lurking in the dark and ready to attack, violence and brotherhood. Liked the detailed description, the mystery about the stones and the intriguing characters that stimulate my imagination. \u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon \u003cbr /\u003eA nobody out of place, unworthy dragon, that’s how Connor Hoving had been feeling all his life. If only he had a chance to prove himself in the shifter world and rise to a position he deserved. Could Destiny and Fate join their forces to look after Connor and bring him what he needed most? Jenna was afraid, watching around all the time, but what was the threat she was hiding from? Meeting Connor seemed to be an answer to her needs, in more than one way. Intriguing and suspenseful story with characters full of mystery. Liked the adventure, the magic, the shifters, the romance and the well-crafted plot development that kept me enjoying the characters different dramas. Good beginning to the new series with an interesting mythological character that I liked and kept my attention to the details. \u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens Paris\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie discovered that her dreams had some truth behind. Coveted by dragons, vampires and gargoyles, she was an important piece in a game of power. Dragon shifter Tristan had not had a fair hand in his life but when he met Natalie he was struggling with his feelings and what was his duty. Natalie wasn’t sure she had enough power to make a difference but what she really knew was that Tristan was the one for her. Liked Natalie’s strong, brave, smart and decided character. She knew how to play hard and in her own terms. As a secondary character Liam was intriguing. Suspense, action, violence, betrayal, funny pet, romance and passion. Interesting and entertaining this first book of a series that promises a lot of action and intrigue.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A16X4UH8QT358Z\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:36731411":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":36731411,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1729084969i/36731411._UY200_CR15,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":16,"textReviewsCount":2001,"name":"Judi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/36731411-judi","contributor":null,"id":36731411},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A32701UUH34BYH":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A32701UUH34BYH"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32701UUH34BYH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A32701UUH34BYH","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A32701UUH34BYH"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/36731411?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3182386766"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.0q4FuXsxHrQg5ZfNLKwncQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.0q4FuXsxHrQg5ZfNLKwncQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:36731411"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581272766137,"createdAt":1581218952302,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581218985300,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eLove these dragons!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI just love Anna’s writing style. I was totally drawn into this world and the mythology is so intriguing. A beautiful setting and characters that worm their way into your heart have made these books fun thrill ride reads.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn Lure of the Dragon these characters draw you in, Tessa is successful, comfortable in her own skin. She has a plan for her life, but she also has secrets in her past even she doesn't know. Kai and his fellow veterans have baggage from their service and growing up. They're hanging together, in a very cool place, supporting each other. Until Tessa comes crashing into their lives with an evil dragon after her, one they know oh so well. This story moves so fast it's over before you want it to be, but it's a fun ride.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSometimes it takes a Rebel to get the job done. In Rebel Dragon Jenna is strong and carefree even when she's afraid of the stalker texting her. Connor didn't have the best upbringing, though his single mom tried. Then he went a little wild in his service days. Now he's buckling down and getting serious. Maybe too cautious? This fast paced tale has action, suspense, and some surprises I didn't see coming, along with a sexy fated romance.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens Paris is a fated mate story on steroids sweeping me away to Paris and a new “world” that is so intriguing that I felt an immediate emotional connection with these characters. Natalie is just a normal American girl taking charge of her life and fulfilling a dream of living in Paris. Tristan is a war veteran coming back to civilian life as a protector for the mysterious Guardians. When they meet it is destiny and it is magic. But the overarching plot of the Fire Maidens also draws you in and it is hopeful even if they have to fight to protect humanity. Loved this action packed, suspenseful romance.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32701UUH34BYH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:25229672":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":25229672,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1434393709i/25229672._UX200_CR0,63,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":17,"textReviewsCount":1517,"name":"Carole","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/25229672-carole","contributor":null,"id":25229672},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-vampire-shifter","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=paranormal-vampire-shifter"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-animal-shifter","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=paranormal-animal-shifter"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mystical-paranormal-magical","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=mystical-paranormal-magical"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"favorites","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=favorites"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3178866720"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.V9cu6SMYnFki2G0eIj9SJA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.V9cu6SMYnFki2G0eIj9SJA","creator":{"__ref":"User:25229672"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581098872130,"createdAt":1581012125207,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581012463511,"text":"Great intro to three of Anna Lowe's Series. Each book in her shifter series show how the author is gifted at giving inner Shifter characters a unique and amusing voice that is distinctly separate from the personalities of their human selves, and it brings lightness and heart to the suspenseful adventures. I also love that all female leads in the series become kick-ass women as they come into their gifts, and battle along with their Fated Mates.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe Lure of the Dragon - I have never been to Hawaii, but I loved that the author invoked the tropical beauty of the island as a backdrop to a Shifter romantic adventure series. I also enjoyed the magical element of the Jewels - Spirit Stones that carry metaphysical gifts. In this book we get a hint of their meaning and power and the gifts and strengths they bring to the women who wear them that builds through the series.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon - I enjoyed the Aloha Shifters-Jewels of the Heart series so much I was delighted that the Pearls of Desire series just moved next door and interacted with previous characters and in an environment that was known and well-loved. Very exciting series with adventure and romance and once again mystical jewels - this time Pearls of Desire, that imbue their owners with magical gifts. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens: Paris - I was sad when the previous two series ended and was delighted the stories continued and in some of the most beautiful European Cities. This series focuses on the reappearance of The Fire Maidens of Myth who meet their Shifter Protector Consorts and once again battle dark forces. This book is set in Paris (sigh) so you will do some wonderful sightseeing in Paris as part of the story.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:27104325":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":27104325,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1759747786i/27104325._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":8,"textReviewsCount":978,"name":"The Reluctant Retiree","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/27104325-the-reluctant-retiree","contributor":null,"id":27104325},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1TSLK8QWOIKCG":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TSLK8QWOIKCG"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TSLK8QWOIKCG\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1TSLK8QWOIKCG","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TSLK8QWOIKCG"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27104325?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3182299421"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Go8ZTRFErQ-hoIG21vsmkg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Go8ZTRFErQ-hoIG21vsmkg","creator":{"__ref":"User:27104325"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581273633140,"createdAt":1581215391704,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581273632905,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eI love Dragons!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe starting stories of three separate series involving dragon shifters. What more could a girl want on here reader? Thanks for this!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt starts with Lure of the Dragon: Kai \u0026amp; Tessa's story\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFabulous as always! Another home run! Love the tie back to the Twin Moon Pack! I was gifted an advance copy which I loved so much, I just had to grab it from KU as well. Well Done!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThen we go to Rebel Dragon: Connor and Jenna.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eO.M.G. This is so fantastic! I Adore the way the author keeps things going from book to book. Definitely ordering the next one!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFinally there is the new series, Fire Maidens: Paris, Tristan and Natalie:\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe action has moved from Hawaii to Europe and a new cast of characters come into view. The same wonderful attention to detail is showcased in the descriptions of the people and places. Thank you so much for all the work you pour into these books.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TSLK8QWOIKCG\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:3476339":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":3476339,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1541422715i/3476339._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":317,"name":"April Pawless","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/3476339-april-pawless","contributor":null,"id":3476339},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ACCOMAL9S1EJ6":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ACCOMAL9S1EJ6"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ACCOMAL9S1EJ6\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ACCOMAL9S1EJ6","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ACCOMAL9S1EJ6"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/3476339?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3188968840"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.w79YrNtuQ_ro0oUOdjubUg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.w79YrNtuQ_ro0oUOdjubUg","creator":{"__ref":"User:3476339"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1582085706346,"createdAt":1581609414893,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581609417295,"text":"Lure of the Dragon\u003cbr /\u003e(Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart #1)\u003cbr /\u003eI am loving this new series from Anna Lowe. OMG, this book was so good. The characters and story sucked you right in. I couldn't stop reading I had to know more about them. I cannot wait to read the rest of the books in this series I am sure they will be great.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon\u003cbr /\u003e(Aloha Shifters: Pearls of Desire #1)\u003cbr /\u003eFirst let me start off by telling you this a spin-off from the Aloha Shifters series. While you do not need to read those books to understand this one, I would highly suggest because you will love it.\u003cbr /\u003eThis book is a great start for a new series. The main characters are really well written and make you want to know what their story is. I cannot wait to read more books in this series.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens: Paris\u003cbr /\u003e(Billionaires \u0026amp; Bodyguards #1)\u003cbr /\u003eI can already tell I am going to love ready this series. I am a sucker for destined mates and this book as all the feels. The main characters Natalie and Tristan are perfect for each other. This book is hot and I can’t wait to read the next","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ACCOMAL9S1EJ6\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:30896044":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":30896044,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1642831401i/30896044._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":47,"textReviewsCount":5475,"name":"Jamoz23","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/30896044-jamoz23","contributor":null,"id":30896044},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/30896044?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3179741020"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.hpE9gg7HlRhmoCJql5amKw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.hpE9gg7HlRhmoCJql5amKw","creator":{"__ref":"User:30896044"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1615020972326,"createdAt":1581055229374,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1615020972119,"text":"The first three books in three thrilling series by a great author.\u003cbr /\u003eYou can never go wrong with this author and though I have all of her books I love having box sets for easy rereading.\u003cbr /\u003eLURE OF THE DRAGON - book one in JEWELS OF THE HEART\u003cbr /\u003eA wonderful new entertaining series from one of my favourite authors.\u003cbr /\u003eThis book introduces us to the beautiful islands of Hawaii, where five Special Forces Veteran shifters with mysterious pasts, who have bonded through the trials of combat have settled.\u003cbr /\u003eI loved the sound of Koa Point, the estate where they all live, how beautifully it is described. Having been to the islands recently it bought back beautiful memories, especially the farmers market.\u003cbr /\u003eI really enjoyed the jewel stone and legends aspect too, cannot wait to see how this all plays out.\u003cbr /\u003eTessa was a strong character and apart from one silly, excusable mistake, was quite believable and entertaining with her actions.\u003cbr /\u003eWe didn’t really get to know much about Kai and I hope we do learn more of him as this series continues whilst his brothers of the heart find their mates and much needed HEA’s. I did love his dragons character and how he kept snipping at Kai about Tessa being their mate.\u003cbr /\u003eLoved the little tie in with Twin Moon Ranch as well through Ella.\u003cbr /\u003eWho will be next, will Silas and Moira reunite and solve past hurts or will it be Grouchy Cruz, Wolfie Boone or rock solid Hunter. From the little teaser we are given Boone is the next to have his life changed for the better. I cannot wait.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eREBEL DRAGON - book one in PEARLS OF DESIRE\u003cbr /\u003eWonderful to be staying in Maui with a new set of shifters.\u003cbr /\u003eA great spin-off series following on from the wonderful Jewels of the Heart. This time we have the Pearls of Desire which have a sad history attached to them but that help out those with true love in their hearts.\u003cbr /\u003eReally liked how Ms Lowe brings the wonderful island of Maui straight into your senses. I can see, smell and feel the lushness of this beautiful island whilst reading.\u003cbr /\u003eTo really get the best of this book I would suggest reading LURE OF THE TIGER first to get more knowledge about Jenna and her special blood.\u003cbr /\u003eIn this new series we get some seriously tough alpha men, Connor, his brothers Tim (a bear shifter) and Chance (a wolf shifter) and their brother of the heart Dell (a lion shifter). If you want to know how three brothers are all different shifters you will have to read this story.\u003cbr /\u003eIn this first story, our Alpha leader Connor is a dragon who is scared of water and is perfect for our mermaid blooded Jenna. He has not always been a good little soldier following orders blindly, unfortunately his brothers tended to follow him so any trouble found them too.\u003cbr /\u003eWorking for Koa Point means a fresh start, a good steady job and a chance to make something of their lives. Living on Koakea Planation means a chance to set down roots. Connor cannot do anything to mess this up. Meeting and falling for Jenna on the plane to Maui could be one big mess up.\u003cbr /\u003eThese men are also former special forces soldiers known to the men of Koa Point, who need a place to settle down and call home. The fact they will also be getting the one woman in the whole world who will complete and compliment them is an added component in making this a great series. Thrown into this mix living at Koakea Plantation is a mystery widowed woman, Cynthia, (a dragon shifter) and her adorable little boy Joey.\u003cbr /\u003eJenna is fleeing to Koa Point and her sister Jody. The chance of working for Teddy Akoa making surf boards in one not to be missed but getting away from her stalker is what prompted this quick change of direction in her life.\u003cbr /\u003eMeeting the tough silent Connor on the plane and feeling safe in his presence gives Jenna the chance to sleep for the first time in weeks. Finding out he is living on the plantation next door to Koa Point gives them the chance to spend time together.\u003cbr /\u003eLove how this story flows and the surprise with Jenna’s stalker was good.\u003cbr /\u003eCannot wait to read Cynthia’s story as well as the rest of the boys.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFIRE MAIDENS 1 - PARIS\u003cbr /\u003eA nice new series from Ms Lowe that takes us to Paris where there is trouble brewing.\u003cbr /\u003eWe will get other major European cities in this series needing and finding their Fire Maidens.\u003cbr /\u003eI loved the tie in off everything needing balance between the shifter and human worlds. Discord in the shifter world causes discord in the human world. To keep things balanced Fire Maidens are needed in the major European cities but unfortunately there have been none for hundreds of years. \u003cbr /\u003eUntil Natalie, an American who has dreamed of Paris since she was a child. Finally deciding to live her dream instead of waiting, Natalie finds herself living and working in her dream city.\u003cbr /\u003eNot going to hash out the storyline as it is quite busy, so read and know what is happening for yourself\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie has a heart of gold and though she can be hot headed at times, she is a great Fire Maiden.\u003cbr /\u003eTristan is the quintessential quiet, broody and strong alpha hero dragon shifter. He really doesn’t say much, his dragon is more verbose than he is.\u003cbr /\u003eThe little mention of current events with the fire at the Notre Dame was really good and the whole story was so descriptive I felt like I was there.\u003cbr /\u003eI sometimes felt there was too much internal dialogue but overall this did not detract from my reading pleasure.\u003cbr /\u003eThe next book is Liam and is based in London which I am looking forward too.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:11862487":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":11862487,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1499227495i/11862487._UY200_CR23,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":5,"textReviewsCount":4342,"name":"Jane Elizabeth ","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/11862487-jane-elizabeth","contributor":null,"id":11862487},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3PF37IQCAKV02":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3PF37IQCAKV02"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":