Ys9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29345830?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3180548554"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ucF1h83W-KAKo1LyR4emHw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ucF1h83W-KAKo1LyR4emHw","creator":{"__ref":"User:29345830"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581148591235,"createdAt":1581110500143,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581148591234,"text":"This is a really good opportunity to get three juicy steamy stories of hot, hunky dragons who melt your panties off(if you're wearing any) or soaked. I've read all three and let me tell ya I could not get enough of them. I don't even think I could tell you if I have a favorite because they all made me swoon. This is a a little insight of what I thought of the books:\u003cbr /\u003eLURE OF THE DRAGON\u003cbr /\u003eTessa never knew the world of shifters existed until she thrown into by Damien Morgan. A real estate mongrel who not only wanted her as his personal chef but his breeding dragon baby momma...lol...his mate..see Tessa had a special sumthin sumthin a few woman had that dragons needed to keep breeding dragons. Tessa was a personal chef who one day hoped to write her own cookbooks, have a loving family and definitely not be bossed around. So when she was thrown into this new world by Damien she was scared and she didnt know who she could really trust. Her chance came when she was given the second chance by and Ella a fox shifter who helped her escaped and to her to go Koa Point Estate. \"You have to trust them. No one else can protect you from that monster.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSo there she stood in Maui in front of the Estate. contemplating whether to go to a hotel or trust these other shifters with her life or go to a hotel. Then a car comes up to the gate and a man steps out of a car and hubba hubba he is gorgeous. He ask if I'm coming or going. We stare. Or maybe I'm just staring. I adk him his name then he ask me mine for some reason I just blurt it outand thrn tell him why I'm here. He rushes me in the car. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eElla had briefed me on the five elite forces. So it was no wonder. I just had to figured out who was whom. Silas was the leader scary, dragron. But the one behind her, he would protect me. No one touches her. I felt hmmmm..what's the word I'm looking for..I get to you when I find it...any who, Boone was funny, he was definitely the wolf. Hunter, damn! he was the bear. Cruz , he was stand-offish he was the tiger. Oh snap! That means, Kai was the other DRAGRON. But it was something about him that drew me to him. I was scared but not afraid, I was warm, but still felt cold like I was missing something from him.I couldn't place what it was at that moment. Until it was gone. I was gone. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOf course, I got stuck cooking dinner. Which I didn't mind doing. Gave me a chance to show them my culinary skills. Kai and I had some alone time at a Farmer's market. I'm gonna miss this. Tessa thought. Kai loved the way she was in her element. This is his mate. He will claim her his dagron said regardless what the part of Kai though. There's something different about her. And something about her pendant around her neck. We will talk to her after dinner. After they walked back to the guest cottage. She went to bed and he went for a fly just to encounter three scouts saying they wanted his treasure. They wanted Tessa. Kai fought them off and killed two. Kai made it back to in enough time to colapse in front of Tessa in dragron form telling her to go get Silas. Would their be HEA? DRAGON BABIES, get the book? \u003cbr /\u003eREBEL DRAGON\u003cbr /\u003eJenna had to come into the world of shifters quickly especially when she thought she was neutralized by a vampire. She needed to get away and feel safe and what better than your very own Dragon guardian by your side. Connor knew he needed to take his new job seriously for his family's sake but it was something about the girl in the seat next to him on the plane that stirred up his beast. This was a rollercoaster of affair but you had to read it to believe it and believe me it's a heart stopper. I loved every minute of it. To be sitting on your sister's couch and she then turn into this tiger and then told everyone on this estate is a shifter and your mind wonders. I can't explain the book without telling the story I can only tell you please get this book. CANNOT wait for Tim's book. Did I mention she was time enough for a sea Dragon and she whooped that tail....\u003cbr /\u003eFIRE MAIDEN'S:PARIS\u003cbr /\u003eModern day telling of Claudine d'Islay and Breselan.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie came to Paris not become a damsel in distress or a royal princess. She had always dreamt of being amongst the parisians and doing community service. She thrives off of helping people, volunteering in soup kitchens served that purpose and gave her a sense of belonging.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTristan worked for the Guardian of Paris. He was to track down rogue vampires. His latest one, Olivier, crept up at the soup kitchen he frequented because of a certain young lady.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie felt deep in her soul and always listen to her instincts, so when she seen the man whom staired at her weirdly she wanted nothing to do with him but considering it was her job to serve the people she did what was tasked. After delivering him his tea he knicked her and her and licked his finger of the droplets of blood from his finger. TASTY!!! YUM!!! Tristan told hold of Nat's hand and ran for her safety. She was safe for now or was she? It was 4 vamps against her and a stranger. A mighty fine stranger. One who saved me. I should not be lusting after. But damn, a girl can dream can't she. When he gave her the way out to save her and he held off the vamps and then suddenly poof, it was one less. She did not understand what happen.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNat feels guilty for leaving the brave man whom finds out his name is Tristan in alley goes back to help. She finds him on the ground but alive. He convince her to take him to his place and then the next day he takes her to the Guardians for help. She doesn't really feel safe with no one but Tristan at this point. Did I forget to mention his place is a penthouse and has this questionable cat name Bijou? You will see what I mean. I almost forgot Olivier said,\"you think blood like that comes along everyday? Royal blood?\" See the royal twist I threw in there?\u003cbr /\u003eWithout going into the book because it's so much. But sooo good. Just know that the characters in this book are insightful, some backstabber, self-sacrificing, dedicated, funny and loyal. This is one of the best suspenseful, mysterious story I've read in a long time. Not to mention best love story and when in France, let's do what the French do, nibble on some banquette. What did you think I was gonna say something else? Get your minds out the gutter. Well, this half the story so you need to get the book.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn the beginning I mentioned this is the modern day tale of Claudine d'Islay and Breselan. I didn't tell you the story. I need you to read and look in chapter 12. A beautiful story. I really feel like telling you the whole story but I need the author to get her credit. Anna has a way to capture you and keeps you there until the end wanting more.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSee what I mean? They are like wow! And I didn't tell you the entire the plots.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:42385062":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":42385062,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1589497157i/42385062._UY200_CR18,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":19,"textReviewsCount":2953,"name":"LeMiliere","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/42385062-lemiliere","contributor":null,"id":42385062},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/42385062?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3183199482"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.kJi6EBKitj_rBBShIGnyTg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.kJi6EBKitj_rBBShIGnyTg","creator":{"__ref":"User:42385062"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581271067048,"createdAt":1581271036229,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581271067048,"text":"The box set features the first book in three of the best paranormal romance series I have had the pleasure of reading. It's a great way to see if you want to read more.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLURE OF THE DRAGON - This is the first book in The Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart series and I loved it. Anna's style of writing is so good you feel every emotion the characters do and the chemistry between Kai and Tessa is hot! All of the characters in this story were well-drawn and I can't wait to read their stories too.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTessa is new to the whole world of shifters, she has always believed herself to be 100% human, but when an evil dragon tries to kidnap her and force a mating she has a very abrupt introduction into the world of shifters. She is aided in her escape by a desert fox shifter who sends her to Maui to a group of ex-military shifters whom she is told will help keep her safe.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOnce on Maui Tessa meets five shifters, two of which are dragons, one bear, one wolf and one tiger. She then finds out that she is not fully human and has to face her destiny. She also finds her destined mate in the form of Kai. Both Kai and Tessa are really strong characters and so well suited to each other. The book was very fast-paced and full of action, twists and turns and super hot love scenes! I can not recommend this book any higher than five stars but if there were more I would give it more, for me it was both thrilling and emotional. I loved it!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eREBEL DRAGON - This book is the first in Aloha Shifters: Pearls of Desire Series which is a spinoff from her Jewels of the Heart series and is again set in Hawaii.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt is a fantastic start to a series, the writing is excellent as you would expect from Anna Lowe, her descriptions bring the settings to life so vividly. Her characters have such depth and the plotline is very good. The two main characters in this book are Jenna (who is the sister of Jodi whom we met in the previous series) and Connor who is a dragon shifter.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJenna is going to Maui to work with her sister but also to get away from a stalker. Being human she has no idea that shifters exist or that her sister is mated to one. Or that the place she is going to live contains various types, dragons, wolves, bears and tigers to name but a few. On the plane over, she meets Connon not realising that they are headed to the same place. Connor is going to work at a private estate as head of security, little realising that he won't just work, he will find his destiny if he is prepared to fight for it!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI'd love to tell you more but I won't because it would spoil this fantastic story what I can say is that there is no escaping destiny, even if it means fighting to achieve it. Jenna is both strong and brave and Connor, well Connor is a dragon how could he not be special?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFIRE MAIDENS PARIS - This is the first book in the Billionaires \u0026amp; Bodyguards Series. It is a standalone series which again features some great characters.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book is about Natalie and her Mate Tristan. Natalie believes herself to be totally human, she has grown up knowing nothing at all about shifters or the supernatural world. She is in Paris because for years she has dreamt about the city and it has been her dream to live in it. She has found herself a tiny apartment, works in a bar and helps out at a homeless shelter.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut one night whilst working at the shelter she encounters two very different men, two men who will change her life forever! One is a vampire and one is a dragon shifter - she is about to see a whole new side to Paris. As she leaves the shelter she is attacked by four vampires and a gargoyle but is saved by Tristan a dragon shifter. They go home to his apartment in an effort to keep her safe and the next day she is taken to meet the Guardians of Paris and is told that she is descended from a powerful legendary shifter queen, that she is, in fact, a Fire Maiden and that she is the saviour the shifters of Paris have been waiting for.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShe is assigned a bodyguard, Tristan, who has returned to Paris after a decade in the Foreign Legion. His mission now is to prove himself to the Guardians of Paris and to protect the city. Being appointed as a bodyguard for Natalie is both a blessing and a curse, it's a blessing because he gets to be close to her and a curse because Natalie is off-limits, she is his charge and he feels way out of his reach.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut just because he's been told to guard and protect but don't touch doesn't mean that the smouldering desire they both feel will go away. When Natalie is captured by bloodthirsty vampires working in tandem with Jacquline, a power-hungry she-dragon she has to dig deep and fight for both her life and Tristan's. With so much at stake, they must win!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere is so much more I want to tell you but then I would spoil this book for you which would be unforgivable of me. What I will say is that I loved this book and if you are a fan of this genre I am sure you will too.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:5907240":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":5907240,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1499301095i/5907240._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":55,"textReviewsCount":2888,"name":"Shayay","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/5907240-shayay","contributor":null,"id":5907240},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5907240?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3183890615"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.tmjMCvJrUlBkdWCdGWA0qg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.tmjMCvJrUlBkdWCdGWA0qg","creator":{"__ref":"User:5907240"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581301907807,"createdAt":1581301896770,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581301907542,"text":"It’s awesome that the first books of 3 great series are all together in this set! I’ve loved all of these series!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHere’s my reviews for each book!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Dragon -\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI love Anna Lowe's books about wolves and I love dragon shifters, so I knew I'd probably love this one, and I was right! Another awesome book! Tessa is on the run from a shifter that was trying to kidnap her; this shifter business is all new to Tessa, so she isn't quite sure what to make of it, so on the advice of a friend, she finds herself in Maui looking for some help from some other shifters, who are supposedly friendlier. Tessa is a tough chick! She's having a lot of crazy thrown at her, and she is handling it very well. Among the various shifters she meets up with, there is Kai, and there is something about him that draws Tessa in, but she doesn't know if she can trust him. Let me tell you, these two create some sparks! Some hot moments between these two! Kai and Tessa's romance is also sweet, and I loved their connection. I loved that we get dual POV's, and I loved all the dragon shifter traits! Love me some fire breathing, high flying, gold/jewel loving dragons! This book is a standalone, but it seems there is a connecting storyline that is going to be going on throughout the series, which I totally love! I'm really looking forward to getting the stories from the rest of the guys! I listened to the audiobook version of Lure of the Dragon, and the narrator did an excellent job! Loved this new series from Anna Lowe, and I'm super excited for more!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon -\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is a spin-off series from my favorite series by Anna Lowe so far, The Aloha Shifters. This story features characters from those books, so for me this series is like a continuation of that series. In Rebel Dragon, there are POV chapters from each of the 2 main characters, Connor and Jenna. I love getting POV from both main characters! It's great to see each of their perspectives.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI enjoyed the action in Rebel Dragon, and I do like that magical items are involved in the storyline. I do wish that the storyline was more different than the previous Aloha series, but I still enjoy that type of storyline. This story moved a little slow for me, and I didn't quite feel the connection with the characters that I had with most of Anna Lowe's characters. I'm not loving the other characters yet, but I'm still looking forward to their books, and seeing them develop. Right now, it seems like they are all basic, but I know Anna Lowe will have some great stories for all the characters. I liked both Connor and Jenna, and they are sweet together, but I didn't quite feel the depth of love most of the other mate pairings have felt. Connor and Jenna are more of a fun and light-hearted mate pairing, which isn't a bad thing, I just love a bit more Alphaness. They do have some steam though! I was disappointed in Jenna with how much she overreacted with her sister's husband, but I appreciated her standing up for herself other times. She's a tough cookie. I always love dragon shifters! I'm on the fence about part mermaids, but it was still a fun scenario. Some under the sea adventures! Overall, I really enjoyed Rebel Dragon, and it was fun and entertaining! I'm interested to see where this series goes!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens: Paris\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eExciting new series! Loved the premise with the whole fire maiden scenario and that the books in the series will take place in different European cities. Here's hoping for cities in Ireland and Scotland! This one is in Paris, and it was fun to touch on some of Paris' attractions. Natalie is surprised to learn that supernatural entities exist; vampires, shifters, etc., but she's even more surprised to learn that she may have more to do with that world than she anticipated. She ends up meeting Tristan; a dragon shifter, who helps protect and support Natalie. Unfortunately, old fashioned ideals get in the way of their connection. Also, an unfortunate, stuck-up supernatural gets in the way as well. The vampires aren't exactly making things easy for Natalie as well, so she's dealing with a whole lot. I love the whole mate connection, and Tristan and Natalie are really sweet together. I do wish Natalie felt a bit more for Tristan or that what she feeling came across better, but overall, they have good chemistry and definitely some heat between them. Entertaining adventure for Natalie and Tristan! I'm really excited to read the next book! ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:21960265":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":21960265,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1517555576i/21960265._UX200_CR0,93,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":25,"textReviewsCount":4646,"name":"Linda Levine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/21960265-linda-levine","contributor":null,"id":21960265},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A118FNB049FYLI":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A118FNB049FYLI"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A118FNB049FYLI\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A118FNB049FYLI","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A118FNB049FYLI"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/21960265?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3183969648"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.dqEs_KQeuj8R_UgnNCaIFg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.dqEs_KQeuj8R_UgnNCaIFg","creator":{"__ref":"User:21960265"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581306091727,"createdAt":1581305143093,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581306091727,"text":"This is a great way to get introduced to three great series. You get the first book in each and will definitely want to read more.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Dragon\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is the first book in the author's new paranormal series featuring dragon shifters and other shifters in Hawaii. I love her wolf shifter stories and was excited to see how she would create this new storyline. In addition to Kai, you have other shifters that have banded together to keep others safe from harm. Many of them have been hurt by humans and women and are not sure how much they trust Tessa. I am looking forward to reading their stories as the information we do get on the other characters is intriguing and I definitely want to learn more about them.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is another great read from Anna Lowe. It is part of a new series but related to the previous one and has many of my favorite characters back. You probably will want to go read the earlier books once you realize how great a read it is but you don't have to.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe author did a wonderful job building the relationship between Jenna and Connor. You get a lot of background that helped me feel like I really understood the characters and why they were making\u003cbr /\u003ethe choices they made. Jenna and Connor have great chemistry from the very beginning.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI liked and respected both Jenna and Connor. I felt like they tried to make the best choices for themselves and others and really cared about the people in their life. He has an interesting family both biological and made by friendship. Connor's devotion to his brothers is very admirable.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe course of love is not easy. The opening is really good and you feel the foreshadowing of danger. The fear keeps building as you wait for the enemy to make their appearance. There are personal issues too that make him hesitant to pursue her. He wants to do what was right and focus on his job\u003cbr /\u003ebut his dragon really pulls him towards Jenna.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe author also does a really good job with developing the other characters too and increasing interest in reading their stories. Cynthia is a really interesting character and hear some of her story Her son helps illustrate a different side to Dell. It definitely make me look forward to hearing their stories. Chase is also a real mystery too especially with how he was raised. I think that will\u003cbr /\u003ebe a very interesting story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI liked the ending and felt it resolved their story but still left room for the other stories. Too many times the author leaves too much open at the end to help bring others to the next books if they want answers. The author doesn't leave the reader with a big cliffhanger but left me with the feeling of looking forward to more.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens: Paris\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie and Tristan are drawn together by love and danger. Natalie has no idea about the other side of the city and that supernaturals exist. Tristan is one of the supernaturals responsible for guarding to the city. He is assigned to be her secret bodyguard on a mission that he doesn't necessarily agree with but one that he feels he can't turn down.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe connection between them is intense from that first meeting. I really love how sweet and caring Tristan is towards Natalie. He really is devoted to her happiness and safety. Natalie is someone that is easy to like. She really cares about others and is perfectly suited for her future role.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI enjoyed the characters and their story fit Paris perfectly. I am looking forward to the next book. Another great love story in another special city.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI am voluntarily reviewing a copy I received.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A118FNB049FYLI\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:7583206":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":7583206,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1727783685i/7583206._UY200_CR20,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":30,"textReviewsCount":2176,"name":"Sarah","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/7583206-sarah","contributor":null,"id":7583206},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17D0E2SYHCOW5":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17D0E2SYHCOW5"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17D0E2SYHCOW5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17D0E2SYHCOW5","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17D0E2SYHCOW5"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7583206?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3615462501"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.WynfmQfzX8eWR6KiYuE0QQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.WynfmQfzX8eWR6KiYuE0QQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:7583206"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1604400222046,"createdAt":1604399925421,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1604400221743,"text":"Book one of the Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the heart by Anne Lowe. \u003cbr /\u003eTessa is a private chef hire by Damien Morgan but while there he attack her but thankfully save by a mysterious woman that told her to go to Maui. \u003cbr /\u003eKai is a special forces dragon shifter that with a few friends/team members made a home on Maui. \u003cbr /\u003eAs soon as he meets Tessa he know something special about her but after a lifetime of mistrust between humans and shifters Kai is struggling with his heart and inner dragon wanting to mate.\u003cbr /\u003eAbsolutely love this first book. It’s a nice easy read/listen and I really enjoyed that the special force team are different shifters with very individual distinctive characters also loved that it was based in Maui a bucket list place for me. \u003cbr /\u003eLooking forward to more in team finding their HEA especially there leader\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBook one of the Pearls of Desire (Rebel Dragon) by Anna Lowe. \u003cbr /\u003eSo this series is a spin off to Jewels of the Heart series, the mated Shifters from previous series decide they need security and hire ex-special forces team and three of the shifters are brothers to live and look after the place. \u003cbr /\u003eConnor get of a flight to Maui to start his new life as security to his friends that live at Kao point and meets his mate Jenna but because he doesn’t realise straight away the go there separate ways at the airport. \u003cbr /\u003eJenna has been trying to get away from her stalker and decides to go see her sister at Kao Point that where she bums into Connor again and they find out their living in same place. \u003cbr /\u003eThis book is a bit different to other because three of the shifters are brothers but surprisingly they are different shifter animals because there deadbeat dad could shift into anything and they all have different mothers. \u003cbr /\u003eI absolutely loved that Jenna didn’t resist much when things heated up with her and Connor and it felt like the relationship developed really nicely and naturally. \u003cbr /\u003eOnly things would say I had against this book is that Jenna never really turns into a proper mermaid but she’s really new to it and I might develop this later in series. \u003cbr /\u003eThe narrator was good but at times did come across as slightly fluffy too upbeat cheerleader which I hadn’t experience with Kelsey Osborne before but I just speeded up the narration speed and which made it a lot better. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBook 1 of the Fire maiden series by Anna Lowe\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie has always wanted to live in Paris and after years of saving she moved to Paris and started living and working there and also volunteer in a homeless centre. \u003cbr /\u003eOne night Natalie was attacked by a vampire and saved by Tristan a dragon. That’s when Natalie is brought into the supernatural world and she finds out that she’s a Fire Maiden and has the power to balance the supernatural world in Paris and bring it to a new calm it only feels that way with a Fire Maiden living happily. \u003cbr /\u003eAbsolutely loved this new series and I have a new love for Kelsey Osborne that not only have the talent to give each character a very individual presence but also had a great french accent as well. \u003cbr /\u003eEven though this book did have a HEA and a proper ending the bad guy and conflict was definitely left as a cliffhanger looking forward to more of this amazing series. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17D0E2SYHCOW5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:37938776":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":37938776,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":18,"textReviewsCount":3147,"name":"Kathi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/37938776-kathi","contributor":null,"id":37938776},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/37938776?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3183907285"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LXlhF7ZpAG_M0mbdh3D2cA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LXlhF7ZpAG_M0mbdh3D2cA","creator":{"__ref":"User:37938776"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581302518458,"createdAt":1581302484377,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581302518220,"text":"A Tantalizing Starter From Brilliant Series!!\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Dragon: **********************************************************\u003cbr /\u003eBe still my heart for this new Aloha Shifters series. We meet them all, but our main character is Kai who is a dragon shifter. Private Chef Tessa just found out there are such things as dragon shifters when one client reveals his true nature and promises to mate her. (Yikes!) Rescued by her neighbor who is also a shifter, Tessa flees to Maui asking for protection from the team at Koa Point.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnna Lowe evokes more “feeling” in her stories than 99% of the authors I read. We immediately relate to each member of the team, feel Tessa’s confusion, and become totally engrossed in the story. It doesn’t hurt that I lived a few years in Hawaii as a kid and as she describes the tropical setting it brings back fond memories. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe story is full of twists, danger, attraction and quite the thrill ride!! It delights me to see there are plans for at least four more stories in this series!! I really need additional stars to award for this one.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon: **********************************************************\u003cbr /\u003eSurfer Jenna has come to Maui to visit her sister and escape a stalker. At Koa Point she finds out the true nature of her sister and the guys on the security team around her. Thrown for a loop she walks along the ocean where she has always felt comfortable.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eConner Hoving is a dragon-shifter who with his team is moving next door to Koa Point at Koakea Plantation. With a father who was a myriad shifter meaning each offspring could be any animal – he was not raised in the protocol of the dragon realm. When these two meet, Conner’s dragon gets very interested and very protective.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJenna is struggling with the fact her sister turns into an eight-foot tiger, the fact she has a little something extra herself and that vampires really exist.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA brilliant island adventure with dragons, tigers and bears….not to mention a feisty kitten and scintillating romance of the fated mate variety. Block off your calendar as you will not be able to put this one down!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens: Paris **********************************************************\u003cbr /\u003eNo Matter the Location; These Shifter Stories are amazing – Taking Europe by Storm!!\u003cbr /\u003eTristan is a dragon-shifter Guardian working to keep the vampires of Paris in check. When they attack a human Natalie, Tristan is there to save her. His dragon is impressed. Natalie is not unaffected:\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“It was ridiculous, reacting to a near-stranger that way. In three years of dating a guy named Dean in Philly, she’d never gotten as excited as she got around Mr. Tall, Dark, and distinctly Parisian.”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCan she be the “mythical” Fire Maiden who can help save Paris? Imagine not only finding paranormals exist, but you may be one….\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIntricate story of honor, duty, jealousy, magic and love. A lovely cat Bijou (jewel) is an additional feature which adds to the depth and believability of this highly entertaining read.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:44563918":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":44563918,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3,"textReviewsCount":834,"name":"Jean Marie","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/44563918-jean-marie","contributor":null,"id":44563918},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A12QVWOM5ZI3U7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A12QVWOM5ZI3U7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A12QVWOM5ZI3U7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A12QVWOM5ZI3U7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A12QVWOM5ZI3U7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/44563918?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3185169521"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.FO26Mh82v2hDQ6HD5cK0aA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.FO26Mh82v2hDQ6HD5cK0aA","creator":{"__ref":"User:44563918"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581377074171,"createdAt":1581377048413,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581377073898,"text":"This is an awesome box set! This provides the first book in 3 different amazing series! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Dragon is the beginning of the Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart series. In an effort to escape a really bad situation, Tessa ends up with Kai and his group of shifters. The fun thing about all the characters in this group is that they're different shifters, they're not all dragons. Kai's brother Silas (also a dragon) seems to be the leader of this group. Tessa is being chased by another dragon (the one she escaped from) and Kai's there to help her. From the moment Kai met Tessa, his dragon was saying she was their mate. Unfortunately, Kai knew that Tessa was human and a dragon's bite is too much for a human as evidenced by his mom. This is a great read to watch how Kai battles not only the dragons to save Tessa but also to watch their love unfold.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon - Aloha Shifters: Pearls of Desire is a new series and Rebel Dragon is the first book in the series.\u003cbr /\u003eThis group is located in Hawaii and has joined the group of shifters that were written about in the Lure of the Dragon, Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart series. Connor and his brothers have come to Hawaii to start over. He feels like it's one of his last chances to prove himself even though he was special forces. While flying to Maui, he meets Jenna, a shy and frightened woman on his flight. Jenna is on her way to meet her sister and escape from what she things may be a crazed vampire stalker. She's hoping to get away but keeps watching over her shoulder fearing she'll never be safe. Connor promises to protect her and she falls asleep on the flight. By the time, the plane lands, they feel a strange connection but part ways with no way of contacting each other. As luck would have it Jenna is sisters with Jody who is mated to Cruz (who's part of the shifters already set up on Maui and the group that Connor is going to join).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThey meet the next day and the pull keeps getting stronger. But Jenna's not telling everyone the truth about her stalker and Connor is trying not to mess up this new job and wants to prove himself as the alpha and take over this new group of shifters. This begins the fun part of the book where you get to see Jenna and Connor and their coming together. Such a great read and an epic battle! Can't wait to read more about this new clan, especially Cynthia and Dell.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens: Paris - This is book one in the Billionaires and Bodyguard Series. This is series is set throughout Europe with each country looking for a \"fire Maiden\" who will reside in their country and bring calm to their country. Although each time, the fire maiden doesn't even realize that she's a shifter. \u003cbr /\u003eEnter Natalie, a human who has left her country to see Paris, but she keeps having two very different dreams involving shifters (vampires and dragons). That's where dragonshifter, Tristan comes in. Natalie doesn't want to believe the tales that Tristan is telling her but she's grateful for him saving her. Can she trust him? This is a great start to another wonderful series by Anne Lowe!\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A12QVWOM5ZI3U7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:16215626":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":16215626,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1636594512i/16215626._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":7,"textReviewsCount":1722,"name":"Pam Louis","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/16215626-pam-louis","contributor":null,"id":16215626},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AXUFBFVY25NRJ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AXUFBFVY25NRJ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AXUFBFVY25NRJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AXUFBFVY25NRJ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AXUFBFVY25NRJ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/16215626?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3184259360"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.xaJ5bKmNV4A1lgi3FdAdng":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.xaJ5bKmNV4A1lgi3FdAdng","creator":{"__ref":"User:16215626"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581325849347,"createdAt":1581325812161,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581325849119,"text":"Book 1 is Lure of the Dragon\u003cbr /\u003eTessa's nightmare started one night when she was hired to to cook for a rich stranger who turned out to be an evil shifter bent on forcing her to be his mate. She was saved by Ella a women who lives next door to her. Ella sent her to a group of shifters in Maui for thier protection.\u003cbr /\u003eWhat she found out was there was a dangerous shifter world she never knew about and now she is in the middle of it.\u003cbr /\u003eOMG this was one fantastic storyline full of action and mystery. The characters are truly amazing and I honestly connected to them fast! This is also the first book in the series (don't worry it's a full story and not a chiffhanger) I can't wait for the next book to come out. I am hooked.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBook 2\u003cbr /\u003eIs Rebel Dragon \u003cbr /\u003eOMG Anna lowe has a new series and if the rest are as good as this one wow!\u003cbr /\u003eJenna is the sister of Jody who is mated to Cruz from the last series and they are both tiger shifters. But Jenna is a human and mermaid mix, she also has a stalker out to get her so she runs to Maui for help.\u003cbr /\u003eConnor and his team are ex special forces who want to make a new lifeature for themselves. He is also a dragon shifter who has come to work security at Koa Point the same place Jenna ran to for safety. Destiny is at work!\u003cbr /\u003eI LOVE this story! Great characters their so easy to connect to. Awesome action, drama, mystery, intrigue, suspense, twist, turns and soooooo much more. It's amazing. I couldn't put it down! The audio version is fantastic too kelsey Osborne makes the story spring to life it was so much fun to hear it.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBook 3\u003cbr /\u003eFire maidens : Paris \u003cbr /\u003eNatlie Brewer had dreams of going to Paris so she did. Everything changed when a vampire attacked . Who knew those things were real well she didn't. She didn't even know she had a heritage in her bloodline that was attracting them to her.\u003cbr /\u003eGargoyles, vampires, and dragons oh my!\u003cbr /\u003eTristan Chevalier's mission is to prove himself to the Guardians of Paris. Protect the city by watching the vampires and reporting on them but when he see natalie in trouble he can't just sit watch and report. Plus his Dragon has other plans for the little human that he is on board with.\u003cbr /\u003eLove the action, drama, mystery, betrayal, spice, and so much more this story has going on in it. The characters are fantastic! The story really pulls you in fast and keeps you interested. I really enjoyed reading this one and can't wait for the next story to come out about London and the next fire maiden.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eGreat set don't miss it . I love the action and spice in all these books!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AXUFBFVY25NRJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:51861022":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":51861022,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1530265