rs: Jewels of the Heart #1**\u003cbr /\u003eThere is: a feisty human female private chef on the run and looking for a place where she can hide and feel safe (Tessa Byrne), a tycoon determined to claim Tessa (Damien Morgan), a friend and fox shifter who risks her cover to save Tessa (Elle), a male dragon shifter determined not to trust any human (Kai Llewellyn), twists \u0026amp; turns, drama, intrigue, mystery, action, adventure, suspense, dragons/fox/wolf/tiger/bear shifters, threats, danger, enemies, distrust, doubt, fear, fated mates, destiny, confrontation, conflict, lust, emotional feelings, love, steamy scenes \u0026amp; a happy conclusion. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e**Rebel Dragon – Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart #1**\u003cbr /\u003eThere is: a young female (Jenna) who is on the run from a stalker and goes to her sister (Jodi) in Koa Point, Maui. On the plane, she meets a man (Connor, a dragon shifter) who is also on his way to the same place, to start a new job in security with his fellow brothers, various kinds of shifters, a apparently human female, a stalker, drama, intrigue, suspense, twists \u0026amp; turns, fated mates, enemies, action, adventure, surprises, magical pearls, attractions, danger, conflict, love, passion, steamy scenes \u0026amp; a wonderful happy conclusion.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e**Fire Maidens: Paris - Billionaires \u0026amp; Bodyguards #1**\u003cbr /\u003eThere is: a young woman (Natalie) decides to move to Paris after a bad experience \u0026amp; discovers a unknown world, a dragon shifter (Tristan) saves her from danger \u0026amp; is determined to protect her, various kinds of shifters, vampires, dragon shifters, twists \u0026amp; turns, intrigue, suspense, drama, mystery, villains, fated mates, adventure, action, danger, threats, violence, attractions, deceit, betrayal, manipulations, devious plans, confrontations, love, happiness, laughter, steamy scenes \u0026amp; a truly delightful epilogue.\u003cbr /\u003eI would recommend this box-set to people who like to read this genre, I really doubt that you would be disappointed.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2PO7GVYIN29I3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:9324085":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":9324085,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1472622127i/9324085._UY200_CR20,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":8,"textReviewsCount":1273,"name":"Crystal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/9324085-crystal","contributor":null,"id":9324085},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2784BSYPUUJ11":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2784BSYPUUJ11"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2784BSYPUUJ11\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2784BSYPUUJ11","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2784BSYPUUJ11"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9324085?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3180367475"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.n-B3YXgN-3Z4NJc9yiCwNQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.n-B3YXgN-3Z4NJc9yiCwNQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:9324085"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581101435713,"createdAt":1581101245508,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581101435477,"text":"Lure of the Dragon - Tessa was attacked and is heads to Hawaii on the word of her friend/neighbor Ella. Trusting that the strangers will really help her. Kai has a feeling that draws him home in time to find Tessa trying to decide if she is ready to ask for help or wait till morning. Kai and his family don't really trust humans much, but she says Ella sent her. Kai also can't help but be drawn to Tessa and he plans on protecting her from the world.\u003cbr /\u003eI really enjoyed this new series and can't wait to find out more about Kai's family, especially Cruz and Boone! Looking forward to the next book and hoping that Ella makes an appearance so we can get to know her as well.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon - Jenna is heading to visit her sister in Hawaii, and also trying to lose her stalker. Conrad along with his brothers and teammates are getting a fresh start after leaving the Special Forces. Jenna's sister told her a few months back that vampires and other things are real and could come looking for her. It was hard to swallow, but it's also becoming the stuff of her nightmares.\u003cbr /\u003eJenna and Conrad share a flight to the island and part ways after the flight even though they are drawn to one another. They soon run into one another, and Jenna gets and interesting surprise from her sister Jody, which leads to some other surprises. One thing leads to another and the bad guys are kind of a surprise. Jenna and Conrad are awesome and I can't wait to find out what happens with the other guys and Cynthia. The woman is hiding a lot.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens: Paris - Natalie headed to Paris to live out her dreams, not planning on finding her self dealing with the stuff of nightmares. Tristan is trying to find his place in the world after leaving the Military. When he saves her and their two worlds collide, it just may be the thing they both needed most. I love Natalie and how she manages to roll with the punches that life seems to throw her way. She faces her reality and doesn't run from 