03eGreat story. Miss Lowe's new story of the Aloha Shifters I expect to be a hit with her readers. getting to know a group of shifters who were in the military together and seeing where life takes them at this point just never gets old.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn this book you're introduced to Kai and Tessa. Kai being a dragon and a jacket of all trades. While Tessa is a personal chef who is being hunted by other dragons.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe story reads swiftly with nary a bump in the telling the characters are well-developed I'm not for sure what more you could ask for great job.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe Mating Bite and A Dragon's Honeymoon just add more spice to the original story. Do forget to read these bonus additions.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLooking forward to the next book Lure of the Wolf.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon\u003cbr /\u003eSecond Nature\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book has more depth than any of the previous stories. I love it. The characters feel a little more complex with back stories I can’t wait to read about. The family dynamic is serious skewed which makes for a better story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere is a misconception that takes the characters on a different path with it being more dangerous than previously thought by Jenna and Connor. These characters work so well together. Each has their own strength and weaknesses that are perceived differently by others and themselves. I love the fact that they grow and evolve throughout the story.\u003cbr /\u003eCan’t wait for the next book in this series.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens -Paris\u003cbr /\u003eBelieve In us\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe start of another series by one of my must read authors.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eComing to Paris has always been a dream for Natalie since she was younger but she imagine how she was going to get there.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTristan has lived in many 