 of a new threat. Love how this author ties everything together.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2D7VA9SG0B38K\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:25668657":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":25668657,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1503506498i/25668657._UY200_CR77,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":9,"textReviewsCount":1134,"name":"Kim","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/25668657-kim","contributor":null,"id":25668657},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A4SHJPO99WB4W":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A4SHJPO99WB4W"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A4SHJPO99WB4W\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A4SHJPO99WB4W","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A4SHJPO99WB4W"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25668657?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3187042346"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.FIiKomXimHMEk9j79z0v7A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.FIiKomXimHMEk9j79z0v7A","creator":{"__ref":"User:25668657"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1581482083166,"createdAt":1581481964321,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1581482082910,"text":"What a great way to get an introduction into 3 wonderful series with this set. Lure of the Dragon starts off the yummy Kai, a wonderful woman on his doorstep, and a legacy. I loved this series because they were hot dragons, marshmallow men for their women, and a tight knit family group. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRebel Dragon starts the next series off and is just as delectable. Connor is the leader of this group and it is a little more rag tagged and brotherhood. He can’t afford for any of them to screw up. And then there is fate. You can’t help but to be team Connor. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFire Maidens of Paris starts the jaunt around the world. Forget Hawaii in the last two series, get packing and solve the mysteries of the shifters and the Fire Maidens starting with Paris. Natalie was so gentle and good natured. Tristan was chivalrous and ever present for her. I loved them both and couldn’t wait for the next city on the tour when the story ended. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A4SHJPO99WB4W\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:61245231":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":61245231,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":143,"name":"Mary Ellen","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/61245231-mary-ellen","contributor":null,"id":61245231},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3E20UQ8G99NV0":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3E20UQ8G99NV0"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3E20UQ8G99NV0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3E20UQ8G99NV0","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3E20UQ8G99NV0"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.eshCIYs9dhlLsA8r"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"defau